<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 CAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk me aryo pa Camuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Camuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Cam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk me aryo pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">CAMUEL</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk me aryo pa Camuel kicoyo kun lubu buk me acel pa Camuel ma tito ododo me loc pa Daudi macalo rwot me acel pa Lujudaya matye i kupiny me lobo Icrael. Loke nonge i cura acel nio wa i cura me angwen me buk man, ki bene tito pi loce i lobo Icrael ducu ma okwako tung kumalo me lobo Icrael ma nonge i coc ma i cura abic nio kwede wa i cura pyere aryo wiye angwen.</para>
  <para style="ip">Man nyutu kore ki kore kit ma Daudi obedo kayaro te loce kun medo dite, ki kit yo ma en otiyo kwede me ribo lwake kacel kun jingo kwede kere bedo tek calo laloc maber. Daudi oyele matek ki lukwore matye i lobo Icrael, ki matye i lobo ma woko ma gurumu Icrael.</para>
  <para style="ip">Daudi obedo dano matye ki niye matut ikom Rwot, ki bene tye ki mar madit ikom Lubanga, dok obedo dano ma ocwiny; ki ngat matye ki kero me tic, ci omiyo onongo cwak ki gen pa jone ducu. Kadi bed kumeno en bene onyutu ni kare mukene etwero tiyo gin ma pe paro pi dano. Dok bene eromo timo bal maracu ada pi cobo mitine nyo gin ma en paro ni etii. Ento ikare ma lanebi Natan onyutu bote bale ma otimo i alii, ci en ongut, kun ye dok otucu ni etimogi; ka lacen en oye ikom bale, ci ojolo pwod ma Lubanga ocwalo pi bal magi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwo ki tic ducu mabeco ma Daudi ceng otiyogi oyomo i jo Icrael ducu mada. Ma omiyo ikare ducu ka peko odiyogi, cwinygi gomo pi rwot macalo wod pa Daudi; atikane lakwar Daudi mo ma bibedo calo en aye otelgi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Loc pa Daudi bot jo Juda <char style="ior"><ref loc="2SA 1:1-4:12">1:1—4:12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Loc pa Daudi bot jo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="2SA 5:1-24:25">5:1—24:25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Mwaka ma ocako ki loc <char style="ior"><ref loc="2SA 5:1-10:19">5:1—10:19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Daudi ki Batceba <char style="ior"><ref loc="2SA 11:1-12:25">11:1—12:25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Peko ki can ma otime <char style="ior"><ref loc="2SA 12:26-20:26">12:26—20:26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Mwaka ma ogiko ki loc <char style="ior"><ref loc="2SA 21:1-24:25">21:1—24:25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi owinyo pi to pa Caulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Inge to pa Caulo en aye obedo kare ma Daudi bene odwogo kwede kacel ki lwak jone ma gucito kaneko jo Amalek. Ci Daudi odike nino aryo i Jiklag. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Inino me adeke laco mo obino kun oa ki i gony pa Caulo, ma bongone bene oyec woko, wiye bene ojuku ki ngom. Ka obino bot Daudi, ci oryebe piny, owore. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi openye ni, “Ia ki kwene?” Ci en ogamo ni, “An abwot ki i gony pa jo Icrael.” <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daudi dok openye ni, “Ci dong kunu tye ningning? Tita.” Dok en ogamo ni, “Dano guringo woko ki i dog lweny, ci kineko lwak jo mapol, ma kiradogi woko piny; Caulo ki wode Yonacan bene guto.” <verse eid="2SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Daudi dok openyo awobi ma otite loki ni, “In kono ingeyo ningning ni Caulo ki wode Yonacan bene guto woko?” <verse eid="2SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:1-6">1 Cam 31:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 10:1-6">1 Tek 10:1-6</ref></char></note>Awobinu ogamo ni, “Onongo atye kunu iwi got Gilboa ci acob ikom Caulo ma ojenge ki tonge, kun gadigadi lweny pa lumeroke ki wegi aguraguragi bene giringo ma gudingo kore adada. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Ka Caulo obolo wange ingeye, ci onena, ci olwonga. An agamo doge ni, ‘An atye ene.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Ci rwot Caulo openya ni, ‘In anga?’ Ci an agamo ni, ‘An jo Amalek.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Ci dok owaca ni, ‘Cung kangeta, wek icuda woko, pien to dong wango koma awanga, ento nen pud akwo.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Ci acung kangete, acude woko, pien onongo dong aniang ni pe dong twero bedo kwo madong opoto woko pinyi. Ci akwanyo lalukana ma onongo tye i wiye, ki ogul matye i ngut cinge, dong akelogi boti, ladita, gin ene.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Daudi ocako mako bongine kene, ci oyecogi woko pi cwercwiny ma omake. Ci jo ma gitye kwede bene gutimo kitmeno. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Gubedo kakumu ki koko ki rii kec pi Caulo ki pi Yonacan, ki pi lwak jo pa Rwot ki pi jo me ot pa Icrael ducu, gukok nio wa otyeno, pien kityekogi woko ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="2SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daudi dok owaco kuman bot awobi ma otite loki ni, “In mono ia ki kwene?” Ci en ogamo ni, “An latin pa labedo mo ma jo Amalek.” <verse eid="2SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Ka Daudi dok owace ni, “Pingo pe kong i lworo tingo cingi pi neko dano ma Rwot owiro?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Ci Daudi olwongo ngat acel ikin awobe orobone, kun wace ni, “Cit ipot ikome.” Ci oneko woko. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daudi dok owaco bot La-amalek ni, “Remoni aliine bedo iwii, pien dogi aye okelo lok ikomi kun in giri iwaco ni, ‘Aneko dano ma Rwot owironi.’”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi okoko Caulo ki Yonacan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Daudi okoko Caulo ki wode Yonacan ki wer man me koko, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:13">Yoc 10:13</ref></char></note>ci owaco ni, myero kipwony ki jo Juda. Loke kicoyo wa i buk pa Jacar. En owero wer me koko ni,<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Icrael do, deyoni kibalo woko iwi cere mutinge!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:19">Twoni oteka lweny dong gupoto woko kuman!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Pe itit pire i Gat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">pe ituc pire i yoo me Acikelon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">miyo anyira pa jo Piliciti gium kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">miyo anyira pa jo ma pe gingeyo Lubanga giwake.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />Wun godi me Gilboa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">toyo pe obed ikomwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">kot pe dong myero ocwer i cerewu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Pien kwot pa otekawa olanye kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">kwot pa Caulo pe dong kijwayo ki moo.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Atum pa Yonacan pe yam dwogo paco</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">ma pe ooyo remo pa dano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">Pala lucwan pa Caulo yam pe dwogo nono</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">ma pe onywane ki moo kom oteka.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Caulo ki Yonacan luyomcwiny dano, jo ma kimaro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Ikare me kwo ki ikare me to gin pe gupoke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Gin ludwiro makato ocur, gubedo lutekkom makato labwor.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Wun anyira me Icrael, wukok Caulo ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">en mayam rukuwu ki bongo makwar, ma deyo ginarukawu ki jabu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Twoni oteka lweny gupoto woko kuman ki i dye mony!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonacan kineko opoto piny iwi cere mutinge.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Omera Yonacan, piny orem</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">kweda woko ikomi do!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Mar meri ikoma yam obedo me aura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">kato mar pa dako woko.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Twoni oteka lweny guto woko kuman!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:27">Jami lwenygi kitenyo woko ata.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi odoko rwot me Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Lacen Daudi openyo dog Rwot ni, “An dong acit abed i taun mo matye i Juda?” Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Citi” Daudi dok openye ni, “Abicito i taun mene?” Ci Rwot owace ni, “I Kebron.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:42-43">1 Cam 25:42-43</ref></char></note>Ci Daudi ocito i Kebron, ki mone magi aryo, Akinoam me Jejreel ki Abigail mayam dako pa lyeli Nabal me Karmel. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />En bene otero jone mayam gitye kwede kunu, kun tero dano acel acel ki jo ma i ode ducu; ci gin ducu gubedo i taun me Kebron. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:11-13">1 Cam 31:11-13</ref></char></note>Ci jo Juda gucito kunu, ka guwiro Daudi me bedo rwotgi ma en loyo jo me ot pa Juda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Ka gitye kunu kitito bot Daudi ni, “Jo me Jabec-gilead aye guyiko kom Caulo,” <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />ci Daudi ocwalo lukwena bot jo me Jabec-gilead, kun waco botgi ni, “Rwot omii gume opot ikomwu, pien wunyutu mar madwong ikom laditwu Caulo, pi yiko kome. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Kombedi Rwot dong onyut botwu mar mere ma pe loke, ki ma geneni! An bene abitimowu maber pi kit tim man ma wutimoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Dong ber wujing komwu, wek wubed jo ma gitek dok pe gilworo lweny, kadi bed ni laditwu Caulo dong oto woko, ci nen jo Juda dong gutyeko wiro an me bedo rwotgi.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Icbocet odoko rwot me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Ikare meno Abneri wod pa Ner, ma lawimony pa Caulo, okwanyo Icbocet wod pa Caulo otero i Makanaim, <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />ci okete me bedo rwot maloyo lobo Gilead, Acer, Jejreel, Epraim ki Benjamin wa lobo me Icrael ducu. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Icbocet wod pa Caulo onongo mwaka me dite oromo pyere angwen ma en cako kwede loyo jo Icrael, ci oloyogi pi mwaka aryo. Ento jo me ot pa Juda gubedo ite loc pa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Kare ma Daudi obedo kwede rwot kun loyo ot pa Juda i Kebron oromo mwaka abiro ki dwe abicel.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lweny ikin jo Icrael ki jo Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abneri wod pa Ner ki lutic pa Icbocet wod pa Caulo gua ki i Makanaim gucito i Gibeon. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Ki Joab wod pa Jeruya ki lutic pa Daudi gucito gurwate kwedgi i kut me Gibeon, ci gubedo piny, kun ngat acel bedo loka kut tungcel ki ngat acel bene bedo loka kut tungcel. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Ci Abneri owaco bot Joab ni, “Wek kong lutino orobo gua malo, ci gutuk i nyimwa.” Joab ogamo ni, “Wek gua malo do.” <verse eid="2SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Ci gua gukato loka tungcel kun kikwano welgi, jo apar wiye aryo ma tung bot Benjamin ki Icbocet wod pa Caulo, ki lutic pa Daudi bene apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Ci ngat acel acel ocako mako wi lakwore, ka cobo bute pil ki pala lucwan, ka gin ducu gurwomo poto piny lawangacel; omiyo kabedo meno kilwongo ni Kelkat-ajurim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="fk">Kelkat-ajurim </char> teloke ni bar lweny ki pala lucwan.</note> matye i Gibeon. <verse eid="2SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Ci lwenye obedo gwar matek inino meno; lutic pa Daudi guloyo lwak pa Abneri ki jo Icrael woko.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Awobe pa Jeruya adek ducu onongo gitye kunu, Joab, Abicai ki Acael. Onongo Acael dwir calo til ma i tim. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />En oryemo kor Abneri, kun ringo kemo en atir, pe loke tung acuc nyo tung acam. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Ka Abneri oloke oneno yo ngeye, ci owace ni, “Meno in Acael?” Ci en ogamo ni, “Meno an,” <verse eid="2SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Ci Abneri dok ocike ni, “Ai loke idok tung acuc nyo tung acam, wek imak latin orobo mo ci iyak jamine.” Ento Acael pe oye weko kore. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abneri dok onwoyo ciko Acael ni, “Ai loke idok kamukene, pe ibed kalubu kora. Lok ango mamiyo acubu in areti woko piny? Ka aneki woko ci abiilo wanga malo me neno wang omeru Joab ningning?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Ento Acael pe oye weko kore, omiyo Abneri ocubu iye ki dim tong, ci dim otucu wa ingeye pil! Acael otugi poto kenyo, ci oto ki kakenyo bene. Dano ducu ma guo i kabedo kama Acael oto iyeni, gubino ci gicung mot laling.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Ento Joab ki Abicai gubedo karyemo kor Abneri; guo wa i got Amma ikare ma ceng dong mito poto. Got meno onongo orine tung Gia, i yoo ma cito i tim me lobo Gibeon. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Ci jo pa Benjamin gucoke kacel i kor Abneri, gudoko buca mony acel, ci gucung wa iwi got kunu. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Ki kunu Abneri ocako lwongo Joab kun waco ni, “Pala lucwan mono bibedo kacamo dano nakanaka ce? Pe ingeyo ni agikine bibedo rac mukato kare? In ibiryemo korwa pi kare marom mene ka wek dong ijuk lwaki guwek ryemo kor omegigi?” <verse eid="2SA 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Joab okwonge ni, “Macalo Rwot Lubanga tye makwoni, kono pe iwaco dogi, kono lwak guryemo kor omegigi nio kwede wa diki odiko.” <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Ci Joab okutu tume, ci lwake gucung woko cut, pe dok gumede ki lubu kor jo Icrael, kadi wa lweny bene dong otugi gik woko kumeno.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abneri ki jone gucako wot i dyewor meno kun giwoto dyewor benebene, kun giwok ki i Araba, ka gungolo kwede kulu Jordan, guwoto nakanaka cake odiko nio wa dyeceng ci guo kwede i Makanaim.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Joab oweko lubu kor Abneri, odok woko cen. Ka ocoko lwak ogurugi kacel, ci gunongo ni lutic pa Daudi madong wanggi orwenyo woko giromo apar wiye angwen, ka pe kikwano iye Acael. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Ento lutic pa Daudi onongo guneko jo Benjamin ma gin aye lwak pa Abneri maromo dano miya adek ki pyere abicel. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Joab ki jone gutingo kom Acael, guyiko i lyel pa wone ma onongo tye i Beterekem. Ka gudwogo ki kunu, guwoto dyewor benebene, nio ka piny oru botgi wa i Kebron.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Lweny obedo ikin jo me ot pa Caulo ki lwak pa Daudi pi kare malac, kun ker pa Daudi dongo mede ameda ki tek, ento ot pa Caulo jwik ajwika dok kwede piny kun goro bene.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobe pa Daudi ma kinywalogi ki i Kebron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Lutino awobe pa Daudi ma kinywalogi ki i Kebron gin ene: latin kayone aye Ammon, ma mine Akinoam me Jejreel; <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />me aryone Kileab, ma mine Abigail dako pa lyeli Nabal me Karmel; me adeke Abcalom, ma mine Maaka ma nya pa Talmai rwot me Gecur; <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />me angwene Adoniya, ma mine Kagit; ki me abice Cepatia, ma mine Abital; <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />ki me abicele Itream, ma mine Egla. Magi ducu Daudi onywalogi i Kebron.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abneri oribe ki Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Ikare ma lweny tye matek ikin ot pa Caulo ki lwak pa Daudi, Abneri onongo tye kamede ki doko dano matek ikin jo ma i ot pa Caulo. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Onongo Caulo ceng tye ki dako mo ma angecane ma nyinge Rijpa, ma nya pa Aiya, ci Icbocet ma wod pa Caulo ni ocako kelo lok ikom Abneri ni pingo en obutu ki ciwone. <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Kiniga omako Abneri matek pi lok pa Icbocet, ci omiyo en owaco ni, “An aye a gwok pa jo Juda bo? Naka watin pud abedo kanyutu mar madwong ikom ot pa woru Caulo, ki ikom omegine ducu ki lureme ducu, peya amiyi i cing Daudi bene ci tin dong icika pi balo wi dako man! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">1 Cam 15:28</ref></char></note>Lubanga myero oket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato bene, kace pe acobo kwong mayam Rwot okwongo ikom Daudi, <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />pi kwanyo ker woko ki i ot pa Caulo, ki pi moko ker pa Daudi wek oloo Icrael ki Juda ducu, cake wa ki i Dan nio kwede i Beer-ceba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ci Icbocet pe dok ogamo dog Abneri ki lok mukene, pien obedo ka lwore.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Abneri ocwalo lukwena bot Daudi i Kebron kun waco bote ni, “Lobo ni mono bibedo ite loc pa anga doki? Ket gicike kweda, ci nen, cinga bidok tung boti pi kelo lobo Icrael ducu boti.” <verse eid="2SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daudi ogamo doge ni, “Meno ber, abiketo gicike kwedi; ento gin mukwongo ma amito ki tung boti tye kit man; in peya ibineno wanga, nio wang ma ikela dakona Mikal nya pa Caulo, bota, ibibino kwede ikare ma ibino ka nena.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:27">1 Cam 18:27</ref></char></note>Daudi dok ocwalo lukwena bot Icbocet wod pa Caulo kun waco ni, “Miya dakona Mikal mayam anyomo ki del kom nyim jo Piliciti me co miya aceli.” <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Ci Icbocet ocwalo dano okwanyo dako woko ki bot cware Paltiel wod pa Laic. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Paltiel olubu kor dakone kun kok pire nio kwede wa i Bakurim. Ka lacen Abneri ojuke ni odok cen, ci laconu odok cen.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abneri ocako yubu lok ki ludongo pa jo Icrael ducu kun waco ni, “Nen, cake wa ikare ma okato ca wubedo ki miti me keto Daudi wek obed rwot ma loyowu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Dong wutim ba, pien Rwot yam ociko pi Daudi kun waco ni, ‘Abimiyo latica Daudi aye bilaro jo Icrael ki i cing jo Piliciti wa ki i cing lumerokgi ducu.’” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abneri owaco bot jo pa Benjamin bene kitmeno, ci lacen ocito i Kebron katito pire bot Daudi kit lok ducu ma jo Icrael kacel ki jo ducu me ot pa Benjamin gutamo ni ber dong kitim.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Ka Abneri oo bot Daudi i Kebron ki jo pyere aryo, ci Daudi otedo karama pi Abneri ki jo ma en tye kwedgi ducu. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Ci Abneri otito bot Daudi ni, “Koni dong amito dok cen, ci abicoko jo Icrael ducu aketogi i cingi, rwoda rwot, wek guket gicikegi kwedi, ka dong i cak loyo lwak ducu kit ma cwinyi mito.” Kitmeno Daudi ocwalo Abneri ocito, kun dok gire ki kuc.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Joab oneko Abneri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Ki inge wot pa Abneri me dok cen, Joab ki lutic pa Daudi gudwogo ki i mony, gukelo lwak jami mapol ma guyako. Ento onongo Abneri dong pe bot Daudi i Kebron, pien Daudi onongo otyeko cwale ocito woko, ci ocito gire ki kuc. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Ka Joab odwogo kacel ki lumony ducu ma onongo ocito kwede, ci dano gutito bote ni, “Abneri wod pa Ner obino kany bot rwot, ci rwot Daudi oweko en ocito woko, ocito gire ki kuc.” <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Ci Joab ocito wa bot rwot ka owace ni, “In ibedo kono katimo gin ango? Nen ba, Abneri obino boti, ci pingo icwale odok woko cen, imiyo en dong ocito woko? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />In mono pe ingeyo ni Abneri wod pa Ner obino ka bwoli, wek enen kama icito iye ducu ki gin ducu ma itiyo?”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Ka Joab oa woko ki inyim Daudi, ci ocwalo lukwena i kor Abneri, gudwogo kwede cen nia ki iwang pii me Cira, ento Daudi onongo pe ongeyo iye lok mo. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Ka Abneri odwogo cen, oo i Kebron, Joab otere woko cen i dog cel me taun macalo mito lok kwede i mung, ci nen otugi cubu iye kikunu, ci Abneri oto woko cut. Joab oneke pi culu kwor remo pa omine Acael. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Ka Daudi owinyo pire, ci owaco ni, “An ki kera ducu pe watye ki alii mo wacel inyim Rwot pi to pa Abneri wod pa Ner. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Aliine opot gire ikom Joab, ki ikom jo me ot pa wone. Ot pa Joab kare ducu pe myero obed labongo dano mo iye ma kome cwer tut, nyo ladobo, nyo dano ma bwoc, nyo dano ma kineko ki pala lucwan, nyo dano ma lakec cam!” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Joab ki omine Abicai guneko Abneri kitmeno, pien yam en Abneri oneko omin gi Acael i mony ma obedo i Gibeon.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Daudi dok owaco bot Joab ki lwak ducu ma gitye kwede ni, “Wuyec ginarukawu, wutwe bongo cola i pyerwu, wek wukum inyim Abneri.” Ikare ma kiyiko kom Abneri, Daudi ma rwotni olubu kor kitarane. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Kiyiko i Kebron, ci rwot Daudi odange ki koko matek iwi lyele, ki lwak ducu bene gukok. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Daudi okoko Abneri kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Abneri myero oto kit ma laming to ni mono?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Badi yam pe kitweyo woko do;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">kit ma dano kome wec inyim latim bwami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">in bene komi owec kitmeno do.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Ci lwak ducu dok gunwoyo koko pi Abneri. <verse eid="2SA 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Lwak ducu gubino ka bito Daudi wek ocam kwon ma piny pud dyeceng, ento Daudi okwongo kwong kun waco ni, “Lubanga myero oket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato bene, kace abilo kwon mo ma ceng peya opoto!” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Ci lwak guniang lok ma i cwinye, omiyo cwinygi okwe; pien kit gin ducu ma rwot Daudi obedo katiyo oyomo cwiny lwak ducu.<verse eid="2SA 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Kitmeno omiyo lwak ducu guniang inino meno ni pe rwot aye ma omiyo ni kinek Abneri wod pa Ner. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Ci rwot Daudi dok owaco, bot lutice ni, “Wun pe wungeyo ni oteka madit ma lawimony dong oto woko tin ki i Icrael? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />An adoko nyap woko ikare man, kadi an rwot ma kiwiro. Awobe pa Jeruya gin aye guketa i peko man. Rwot aye myero ocul kwor ikom latim marac muporo kit bwamine!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kit ma kineko kwede Icbocet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ka Icbocet wod pa Caulo owinyo ni Abneri dong kineko woko i Kebron, ci kome oto woko lirut, ki cwiny jo Icrael bene obale woko. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ikare meno onongo Icbocet tye ki lutel wi buca monye aryo; nying ngat acel Baana ki nying ngat mukene Rekab. Gin ducu awobe pa Rimmon ma jo Benjamin, taun tugi tye i Beerot. Beerot kikwano me bedo ngom me aleya bot jo Benjamin. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Jo Beerot kikome yam guringo gularo i Gitaim, ci gudoko lubedo kunu nio wa ikare man.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 9:3">2 Cam 9:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yonacan wod pa Caulo yam tye ki wode mo ma tyene okwe woko. Ikare ma gukelo lok ki i Jejreel ikom gin ma otime ikom Caulo ki Yonacan, onongo en dong dite oromo mwaka abic. Ci lapidine otinge, oringo kwede woko, ci latin opoto woko piny ikare ma en tye kangwec matek, omiyo odoko langolo. Latin meno nyinge Mepibocet.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Awobe pa Rimmon ma jo Beerot, Rekab ki Baana, gua ci gucito ki i cwiny dyeceng malyeti, gudonyo wa i ot pa Icbocet ikare ma en tye kayweyo i dyeceng. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Gunongo lagwok dogola ma dako ma obedo ka pyeto nganoni, nino omako wange, ci onino woko; man omiyo Rekab ki omine Baana gulwite gudonyo. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Ka gudonyo i ot, gunongo Icbocet obutu i ot butune iwi kitandane, ci gucobe, guneke woko, ka gungolo wiye. Gutingo wiye, gulubu kwede yoo Araba i dyewor, <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />ci gukelo wi Icbocet bot Daudi i Kebron, ka guwaco bot rwot Daudi ni, “Wi Icbocet wod pa Caulo dong wakelo ene, en wod pa Caulo ma lameroki mayam mito neki. Rwot dong oculu kwori tin, rwotwa, ikom Caulo ki ikom lutinone.” <verse eid="2SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Ento Daudi ogamo dog Rekab ki omine Baana, awobe pa Rimmon ma jo Beerot ni, “Macalo Rwot Lubanga tye makwoni, mayam olaro kwona ki i cing lumeroka ducu, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:1-16">2 Cam 1:1-16</ref></char></note>ikare mayam dano mo obino otita lok ni, ‘Nen ba, Caulo dong oto woko,’ ma onongo en tamo ni ekela lok maber, ci an amake aneke woko i Jiklag; meno aye obedo mot ma amiyo bote pi lok ma en okeloni. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Ento lok man dong dit makato ducu, kace lutim aranyi dong guneko dano mo ma cwinye leng ki i ode iwi kitandane, ci wutamo ni an pe abiculu kwore ikomwu, atyekowu woko ki iwi lobo?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Ci Daudi ociko lutino orobone, ni gunek jonu woko, gungol cinggi, ki tyen gi woko, ka gungab komgi inget kulu me Kebron. Ento gukwanyo wi Icbocet, guyiko ilyel pa Abneri i Kebron.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi odoko rwot me Icrael ki me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">1 Tek 11:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">1 Tek 14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Kaka ducu ma i Icrael gucoke gubino bot Daudi i Kebron, ci guwace ni, “Nen ba, wan aye cogo komi ki ringo komi. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Ikare ma con ca, ma onongo Caulo aye rwot ma loyowa, in aye mayam itelo wi jo Icrael ka gicito kalweny, ci idwokowa paco bene. Rwot bene nene owaco boti ni, ‘In aye ibibedo lakwar lwaka jo Icrael, dok ibibedo laker ma loyogi.’” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Kitmeno ludongo pa jo Icrael ducu gubino bot rwot i Kebron. Rwot Daudi oketo gicike kwedgi i Kebron inyim Rwot, ci guwiro Daudi odoko rwot maloyo jo Icrael. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:11">1 Luk 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1 Tek 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:27">1 Tek 29:27</ref></char></note>Daudi ocako loce ma onongo mwaka me dite romo pyere adek, ci obedo kaloc pi mwaka pyere angwen. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Ci oloyo jo Juda i Kebron pi mwaka abiro ki dwe abicel, ka dok oloyo jo Icrael ki jo Juda ducu ki i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere adek wiye adek.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi omayo got Cion</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:4-9">1 Tek 11:4-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 15:63">Yoc 15:63</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 1:21">Lung 1:21</ref></char>
    </note>Kare oromo ma Rwot Daudi ki lwake gucito i Jerucalem kalweny ikom jo Jebuc ma gibedo i lobo kunu. Gin onongo guwaco bot Daudi ni, “In pe ibidonyo kany. Ka ibino, ci lungolo ki lutowang aye gibiryemi woko ki cen.” Onongo gutamo ni Daudi pe twero donyo kunu. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Ento Daudi ocito omayo cel gogo me Cion woko, ci odoko gang kale. <verse eid="2SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Inino meno Daudi owaco ni, “Dano ducu ma gimito neko jo Jebuc gudony ki iwang otul pii, ci gucak lweny ikom lungolo ki lutowang ma tipu koma okwerogini.” En gin ma omiyo kiwaco ni, “‘Lutowang ki lungolo pe gibidonyo i ot pa Lubanga.’” <verse eid="2SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Daudi ocako bedo i cel gogo kunu, ci olwongo ni, “‘Gang kal pa Daudi.’ Ci Daudi ogero taun madito orumu woko liking cake ki i Millo.” <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Daudi omede odoko dit tutwal, pien onongo Rwot Lubanga me mony tye kwede.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiram opwoyo ker pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:1-2">1 Tek 14:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Kiram rwot me Turo ocwalo kwenane bot Daudi kun miyo bao yat cedar, ki lupac bene ki lupaa godi me gero ot pa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ci man omiyo Daudi oniang ni, “Rwot otyeko moko en me bedo rwot maloyo Icrael, dok ni Rwot omiyo kere obedo ki deyo madwong pi pilo wi jone Icrael.”<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lutino ma Daudi onywalogi i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 3:5-9">1 Tek 3:5-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:3-7">14:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Daudi dok omede ki kwanyo mon angeca ki mon anyoma mukene ki i Jerucalem ki ikare madong oa woko ki i Kebron, ci onywalo awobe ki anyira mukene. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Man aye nying awobe pa Daudi ma onywalogi ki i Jerucalem: Cobab, Natan, Solomon, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibar, Elicua, Nepeg, Japia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elicama, Eliada ki Elipelet.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oloyo jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Tek 14:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Ikare ma jo Piliciti guwinyo ni Daudi dong kityeko wiro ki moo, odoko rwot maloyo jo Icrael, ci gucoke ducu gucito ka yenye; ento ka Daudi owinyo pirgi ci odonyo woko i cel gogo. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Jo Piliciti gumol gubino ci guket guromo i nota Repaim woko. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Daudi openyo dog Rwot ni, “Ber acit kalweny ikom jo Piliciti? Ci ibimiyogi i cinga?” Rwot ogamo dog Daudi ni, “Citi, pien abimiyo jo Piliciti i cingi ada.” <verse eid="2SA 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Daudi ocito wa i Baal-perajim, oloyogi ilweny ki kunu, ci owaco ni, “Rwot obaro dye lumeroko woko ki inyima, macalo lalele mucore.” Ma omiyo nying kabedo meno kilwongo ni Baal-perajim. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Ci jo Piliciti gutenyo cal jogigi kenyo. Daudi ki lwake gutingo gutero woko.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Jo Piliciti dok gudwogo, gumol guket i nota Repaim ducu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Ka Daudi dok openyo dog Rwot, ci Rwot ogamo doge ni, “Pe ibicito atir. Ber icit iman nge monygi ma odong cen ca, wek ipot ikomgi ki kama okemo yadi owak. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Kace iwinyo woo macalo lwak dano ma gitye ka dore iwi yadi owak, ci irune anyim oyot, nongo Rwot Lubanga dong bitelo nyimwu pi neko mony pa jo Piliciti woko ducu.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Ci Daudi otiyo kitmeno kit macalo Rwot ocike kwede, ci oneko jo Piliciti cake ki i Geba o kwede wa i Gejer.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi ocito kaomo Canduk pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Tek 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:6">15:25—16:6,43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Daudi dok ocoko lulweny mabeco ma kiyerogi ayera ki ikin jo Icrael ma giromo alip pyere angwen. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Nia 25:22</ref></char></note>Ci Daudi ocako a ki jone ducu ma gitye kwede, gucito kwedgi wa i Baale-juda kaomo Canduk me Gicike, ma kilwongo ki nying Rwot me mony ma bedo iwi komkere malo ka wi lukerubi. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:1-2">1 Cam 7:1-2</ref></char></note> Ka gutingo Canduk iwi gadigadi manyen, ci gukelo woko ki i ot pa Abinadab, ma gange onongo tye iwi gotti, Uja ki Akio, ma gin awobe pa Abinadab, aye gubedo kaleko twoni ma ywayo gadigadi manyeni <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />ma gitingo ki Canduk me Gicike, kun Akio aye telo nyime. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daudi ki jo me ot pa Icrael ducu gubedo kayare ki myel ki yomcwiny inyim Lubanga ki kero komgi ducu, ki wero wer, ki goyo opuk ki nanga ki ajaa ki bul ki atego me agoyagu.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Ka guo i laro moyo pa Nakon, ci Uja ocwalo cinge, ogudu kom Canduk me Gicike, omako kome, pien onongo twoni gucato, <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />ci kiniga omako Lubanga ikom Uja, oneke woko ki kunu, pien onongo oketo cinge ikom Canduk; ci oto woko ki kunu inget Canduk me Gicike. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Kiniga omako Daudi pien Rwot otuge ikom Uja; man omiyo kabedonu kilwongo ni Perej-uja nio wa onyo. <verse eid="2SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Ci Daudi obedo ki lworo ikom Rwot inino meno; ci owaco ni, “Canduk pa Rwot dong kibitero bota ningning?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Kitmeno omiyo Daudi okwero tero Canduk pa Rwot i gang kale; ento ongak kwede woko, otero i ot pa Obed-Edom ma jo Gat. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:4-5">1 Tek 26:4-5</ref></char></note> Canduk pa Rwot obedo i ot pa Obed-Edom pi dwe adek; ci Rwot omiyo gum bot Obed-Edom ki jo ma i ode ducu.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikelo Canduk me Gicike i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 15:1-16:6">1 Tek 15:1—16:6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Ka kitito loki bot Daudi ni, “Rwot otyeko miyo gum ikom jo ma i ot pa Obed-Edom ki gin ducu matye bote, pi Canduk me Gicike,” ci omiyo Daudi ocito kaomo Canduk ki i ot pa Obed-Edom ci okelo i gang kale ma cwinye yom matek. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Ka jo ma gutingo Canduk pa Rwot gudako tyen gi ki wot tyen abicel, ci Daudi omiyo gitum me twon ki romo ma ocwe bot Rwot. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Lacen en ocako myel inyim Rwot ki tipu kome ducu, kun onongo otweyo pyere ki epod me bongo camanini. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Kitmeno Daudi ki jo me ot pa Icrael ducu gukelo Canduk pa Rwot i Jerucalem ki wayu ki kutu bila.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Ka canduk pa Rwot obino i gangkal pa Daudi, ci Mikal ma nya pa Caulo obolo wange ki iwang dirica, ci oneno ka Daudi pye kire ki myel inyim Rwot; ci obedo kacaye ki i cwinye. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Gukelo Canduk pa Rwot wa paco, ci gucibo i kabedone, ma en aye kema ma Daudi oguru pire. Ci Daudi ocako tyero gitum awanga mapol ki gityer lakwe cwiny bene inyim Rwot. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Ka Daudi otyeko tyero gitum awangagu ki gityer lakwe cwiny, ci olamo gum ikom lwak ki kunu inyim Rwot me mony. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:43">1 Tek 16:43</ref></char></note>Lacen Daudi opoko cam bot lwak ducu, pi jo Icrael ducu ma gucoke, co wa ki mon. Dano acel acel kimiye mugati acel, ki ringo ma oceke, ki poki olok mutwo. Ka dong lwak gucako ket, kun ngat acel acel dok i gange.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Ka Daudi odok cen ipacone wek eleg Rwot olam gum ikom jo ma i ode, Mikal nya pa Caulo okati woko ka jole, ci owaco bote ni, “Rwot me Icrael tin oketo deyo ikome kene ba! Pe tin obumu kome keken iwang angeca magi ducu! Rwot tin obedo macalo ngat mo ma lamalgang ata ma lewic pe mako, ma pe kilworo kun mede ameda ki bumu wa kome bene.” <verse eid="2SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daudi ogamo dog Mikal ni, “An abedo ka myel inyim Rwot, ma oketo an abedo rwot ma ka woru, kun aloyo ode ducu. En oketa abedo laker maloyo jo Icrael, ma lwak pa Rwot. Abimyelo myel ki yomcwiny inyim Rwot. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />An amito abed yot makato man, wek abed gira gin anyerani; ento angeca ma iloko ikomgi ni aye dok gibiketo deyo ikoma makato.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Mikal nya pa Caulo pe omedo kinywalo latin mo, nio ka oto.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga oketo gicikene ki Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-27">1 Tek 17:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Ikare ma dong rwot Daudi obedo i ode, ma onongo Rwot omiye yweyo ki ikom lumeroke ma gurume dyereni, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />ci rwot owaco bot lanebi Natan ni, “Nen ba, an dong abedo i ot bao cedar, ento Canduk me Gicike pud bedo i kema.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Natan odok iye bot rwot ni. “Cit itii gin ducu matye i cwinyi, pien Rwot tye kwedi.”<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Ento i dyewor acelu en aye dok Rwot obino ci oloko ki Natan kun waco ni, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Cit itit bot latica Daudi ni Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘In imito gera ot me bedona? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />An peya abedo i ot mo cake ki ikare mayam akwanyo jo Icrael ki i Ejipt o kwede wa onyo ni, ento kibedo kawire kweda kun abedo gira i kema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />I lwak kabedo ducu ma abedo kawire iye ki jo Icrael ducu, onongo kong yam aloko lok mo bot lutela pa jo Icrael, ma acikogi pi kwayo lwaka jo Icrael, kun awaco ni, pingo pe kong wugera ot mo me bao cedar?’<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />Ma omiyo dong ibiwaco bot latica Daudi ni, ‘Rwot me mony owaco kit man ni. An yam akwanyo in ki ka kwat i olet, kama ibedo iye ka leko romi; wek ibed laker maloyo jona jo Icrael. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Dok abedo kalonge kwedi i kabedo ma icito iye ducu, abedo ka jwero lumeroki woko ki inyimi. An dok abimiyo nyingi ywek marom ki nying jo madito ma iwi lobo ni. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Dok abimiyo kabedo ki jona jo Icrael, ci abiketogi iye, wek dong gubed i kabedogi kikome, ma pe dong kiyelogi matwal, wa lulweny magwar bene pe dok biete pi bino me poto ikomgi ikare mo, kit ma con ca, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />cake ki ikare mayam aketo iye lungolkop ma giloyo jona jo Icrael. Dong abimiyo iywe ki lweny ikom lumeroki ducu. Dok Rwot otyeko tucu boti ni en ebimiyo jo ma i odi gibedo mapol. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:3-4">Jab 89:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:11">132:11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:42">Jon 7:42</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:30">Tic 2:30</ref></char></note>Ka kareni oromo ma dong i to ci kibiyiki kacel ki kwarini, ci abimiyo wodi mo ma in kikomi inywalo bedo madit, ci abimoko kere bedo matek. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />En aye bigero ot pi nyinga, an abimoko komkere bedo matwal. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:26-27">Jab 89:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:18">2 Kor 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Ibru 1:5</ref></char></note>An abibedo wone, ki en bibedo woda. Kace otimo bal, ci abipwode ki odo pa dano, ki kit goco pa awobe pa dano. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Ento pe abikwanyo mar mera ma pe loke woko ki ikome, kit mayam akwanyo ki ikom Caulo, mayam aryemo woko ki i nyimani. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:36-37">Jab 89:36-37</ref></char></note>Odi ki keri bimoko inyima nakanaka; ki komkeri bene bimoko matwal.’”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Natan otito lok magi ducu bot Daudi, ki kit ginanyuta ma onen bote ducu.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi omiyo pwoc bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Tek 17:16-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Lacen Daudi ocito obedo piny inyim Rwot i kema ma Rwot bedo iyeni, ci owaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, an anga, ki oda bene kono gin ango, ma omiyo ikonya nio wa onyooni? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Ento in pud ibwono kony man ni tidi ki tung boti, ai Rwot Lubanga ibedo kalok ikom dano ma i oda kit ma gibibedo kwede pi kare malac matye anyim, inyutu bota kit ma likwaya bibedo kwede i anyim, ai Rwot Lubanga! <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />An Daudi dok abiwaci kit lok ango? In ingeyo an, ai Rwot Lubanga ma an laticini. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Itiyo gin madit magu ducu pi lubu lok mayam iloko pi mitini keni, wek an latici anen ki wanga. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />In idit mada, ai Rwot Lubanga; pe tye ngat mo macalo in, pe tye Lubanga mo, kono in keken, kit mayam wawinyo ki itwani. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:34">Nwo 4:34</ref></char></note>Rok mene ma iwi lobo marom ki joni jo Icrael, mayam in Lubanga icito ka kokogi ki i opii wek gubed joni wek nyingi oywek pirgi, pi tim madito ma itimo mamiyo lworo, ki pi ryemo rok mukene mapol woko ki inyimgi, kacel ki lubangagi?” <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />In ityeko moko lwaki jo Icrael wek gubed joni nakanaka; dok in, ai Rwot, idoko Lubangagi.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Ai Rwot Lubanga, kombedi dong imok lok mayam iwaco ikoma ki ikom jo ma i oda matwal, ci dong itim kit ma iwaconi. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Kumeno dano gibidworo nyingi nakanaka kun kiwaco ni, ‘Rwot Lubanga me mony aye Lubanga maloyo jo Icrael,’ ki wek ot pa latici Daudi omok inyimi matwal. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Ai Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, in aye inyutu tami bota, an latici, kun iwaco ni ibimiyo oda bedo madit; en gin ma omiyo an latici alimo tekcwiny me kelo lega man inyimi. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />Ai Rwot Lubanga, in aye Lubanga, loki bedo me ada, ki in bene dong ityeko cike me timo gin man maber pira. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Pimeno, alegi ni imii gum ikom jo ma i oda, wek gumede ameda ki bedo ki kica inyimi nakanaka; pien in, ai Rwot Lubanga, ma igwoko cikeni ma dong iwaco, dok pi loki me gum weko ibimiyo likwaya bibedo ki gum nakanaka.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi omedo kere odoko malac</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Tek 18:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Lacen Daudi dok otayo jo Piliciti, ci ocako loyogi, dok omayo Meteg-ama ki i cinggi. <verse eid="2SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Daudi dok otayo jo Moab, ka opimogi ki tol, kun omiyo gubutu abuta piny i ngom. Ci en opimo tol aryo me aneka ki tol acel me aweka makwo. Ci jo Moab gubedo ite loc pa Daudi, kun giculu mucoro bote.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Daudi dok otayo Adadejer wod pa Rekob rwot me Joba, ma onongo ocito ka roco kere odoko tek i dog kulu Euprate. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi omako wegi aguragurane alip acel ki miya abiro, ki acikarine ma giwoto ki tyen gi alip pyere aryo. Ongolo odon tyen aguragura ma ywayo gadigadi lwenygi, ento oweko mogo manok odong maromo ywayo gadigadi miya acel. <verse eid="2SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Ka jo Ciria me Damaciko gubino ka konyo kor Adadejer me Joba, ci Daudi oneko jo Ciria alip pyere aryo wiye aryo. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Daudi oketo lumonye i cel gogo kadi wa i lobo Ciria matye inget Damaciko; ci jo Ciria ma gitye kunu gubedo ite loc pa Daudi kun giculu mucoro bote. Rwot obedo kamiyo tek me bwoyo lobo bot Daudi kama en ocito iye ducu. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Daudi oyako lwak kwot me jabu mayam lutic pa Adadejer tingogi, ci oterogi woko wa i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Dok rwot Daudi oyako lwak jami mapol me mola ki i Beta ki Berotai, mayam obedo taun pa Adadejer.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Ikare ma Toi rwot me Kamat owinyo ni Daudi otyeko tayo mony pa Adadejer woko ducu liweng, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />ci Toi ocwalo wode Joram bot Daudi ka mote, kipwoye pi lweny ikom Adadejer ki pi loyo en woko; pien yam Adadejer obedo kalweny ki Toi tyen mapol. Joram ceng obino bot Daudi ki jami me ryal ki jabu ki molagu; <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />jami meno bene rwot Daudi odyerogi woko bot Rwot Lubangane, kacel ki ryal ki jabu mukene ma en odyero ma oyakogi ki bot rok ducu ma en otayogi ilweny; <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />macalo jami ma oyakogi ki bot jo Edom, jo Moab, jo Ammon, jo Piliciti ki jo Amalek, kacel ki jami ma en oyako ki bot Adadejer wod pa Rekob, rwot me Joba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 60:2">Jab 60:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Daudi olimo yweka pi teke kene. Dok ikare ma dong en tye ka dwogo cen ki ilweny, en oneko jo Edom alip apar wiye aboro i nota me Kado. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Daudi oketo lumony i cel gogo ma i Edom, kun guromo i lobo Edom ducu, ci jo Edom gubedo ite loc pa Daudi. Rwot Lubanga omiyo Daudi obedo ki loc ikom lobo ducu kama en ocito iye kalweny.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludito pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:14-16">1 Tek 18:14-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Daudi oloyo jo Icrael ducu kitmeno; dok obedo kangolo kop atir dok kakare ikom lwake ducu. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Joab wod pa Jeruya obedo ladit me monye; ki Yekocapat wod pa Akilud obedo laco lok ma time. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Jadok wod pa Akitub ki Akimelek wod pa Abiatar gubedo ajwaki; Ceraya obedo karan; <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya wod pa Yekoyada obedo ladit maloyo jo Keret ki jo Pelet; ki awobe pa Daudi gubedo ajwaki.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Kica omako Daudi ikom Mepibocet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 20:15-17">1 Cam 20:15-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Daudi openyo ni, “Tye ngat mo ma odong ki i ot pa Caulo, wek anyut cwiny me mar ikome pi Yonacan?” <verse eid="2SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Ikare meno onongo latic pa Caulo mo ma nyinge Jiba tye kakenyo. Kilwonge ci kikele bot Daudi, ci rwot openye ni, “In aye Jiba bo?” En ogamo ni, “An do, ladit.” <verse eid="2SA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 4:4">2 Cam 4:4</ref></char></note> Ci rwot Daudi dok openye ni, “Pe tye ngat mo ma odong ki i ot pa Caulo, wek anyut cwiny me mar pa Lubanga ikome?” Ci Jiba owaco bot rwot ni, “Wod pa Yonacan pud tye, ento tyene aye okwe woko.” <verse eid="2SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Rwot openye ni, “En kono tye kwene?” Jiba ogamo ni, “En bedo i ot pa Makir wod pa Amiel, i Lo-debar.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Ci rwot Daudi ocwalo dano wek kiome ki i Lo-debar. <verse eid="2SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Ka Mepibocet wod pa Yonacan ma wod pa Caulo ni obino bot Daudi, ci opoto oryebe piny omiye woro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Daudi owace ni, “Mepibocet!” En ogamo ni, “An latici a en do.” <verse eid="2SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Daudi dok owaco bote ni, “Pe ibed ki lworo mo. An abinyuti cwiny me mar pi woru Yonacan, abidwoko boti lobo ducu mayam pa kwaru Caulo, dok ibicam iwi mejana jwijwi.” <verse eid="2SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Ci Mepibocet dok omiye woro kun waco ni, “An kono anga, ma omiyo itamo pi gwok mamwa ma oto macalo an ni?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Daudi dok olwongo Jiba latic pa Caulo, ci owace ni, “Jami pa Caulo ki jo ma i ode ducu atingo amiyo bot Mepibocet. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />In ki awobeni ki lutici wubipuru potone ducu, wek cam ocek iye, wek wod pa laditi onong iye ginacama mo. Ento en Mepibocet wod pa laditi bicam iwi mejana jwijwi.” Kare meno onongo Jiba tye ki awobene apar wiye abic, ki lutice pyere aryo. <verse eid="2SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Ci Jiba ogamo dog rwot ni, “An abitiyo kit ma icika kwede ni ducu, ladit rwot.” Kitmeno Mepibocet ocako cam iwi meja pa Daudi marom ki ngat acel mo ikin awobe pa rwot. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mepibocet onongo tye ki wode mo matidi ma nyinge Mika. Ci jo ducu ma gibedo i ot pa Jiba gudoko lutic pa Mepibocet. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Mepibocet ocako bedo i Jerucalem, pien en obedo kacam jwijwi iwi meja pa rwot. Pien onongo en ongol woko i tyene aryo ducu.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi otayo jo Ammon ki jo Ciria</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Tek 19:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Ka man otum, rwot me Ammon oto, ci wode Kanun oleyo katyene. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Ci Daudi otamo kuman ki i cwinye ni, “Abinyutu cwiny me mar bot Kanun wod pa Nakac, kit mayam wone onyutu kwede cwiny me mare botani.” Ma omiyo Daudi ocwalo lutice ka kweyo cwiny Kanun pi to pa wone. Ka lutic pa Daudi guo i lobo pa jo Ammon, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />ci rwodi pa jo Ammon gucako waco bot laditgi Kanun ni, “In itamo ni Daudi mono ocwalo lwake me kweyo cwinyi pi keto deyo ikom woru? Daudi mono pe ocwalo lutice kangiyo taun ki karoto kite ducu, wek etur woko?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Kitmeno omiyo Kanun omako lutic pa Daudi, ci olyelo yer tik ngat acel acel woko tung cel, ka dok ongolo dye bongigi ikom pyergi, ka ocwalogi kwede woko kumeno. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Ka kitito pire bot Daudi, ci en ocwalo dano ka jologi, pien onongo gitye ki lewic madwong tutwal. Ci rwot owaco botgi ni, “Kong wubed i Jeriko, nio ka yer tikwu otwi olot, ka dong wudwog kany.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Ka jo Ammon guneno ni dong gingeto i Daudi, ci gucwalo dano kawilo jo Ciria ma i Betrekob, ki jo Ciria ma i Joba, wek gukel acikari alip pyere aryo ma giwoto ki tyen gi, ki bot rwot me Maaka ma en obino bene ki dano alip acel, ki jo Tob ma giromo alip apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Ka Daudi owinyo pirgi, ci en ocwalo Joab kacel ki buca mony pa twoni oteka lwenye ducu. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Ci jo Ammon gubino gurwayo cok ka gurye i dogcel; ki jo Ciria me Joba ki me Rekob, ki jo Tob ki jo Maaka gupoke mere ken gi, gurye i dye bar.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Ka Joab oneno mony okace woko ryoryo, tung nyime ki tung ngeye bene, ci oyero jo Icrael ma oyita lweny, ocako ryeyogi gukemo jo Ciria. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Oketo jo mudonge bot omine Abicai, ma gin bene guryeyo gukemo jo Ammon. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Ci Joab owaco ni, “Kace jo Ciria gubedo tek ikoma, ci ibikonya; ento ka jo Ammon aye gubedo tek ikomi, ci an abibino kakonyi. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Bed oteka ma cwinyi nwang, wek walweny lweny me co pi lutuwa, ki taun wa ma Rwot Lubangawa omiyo ki wan, Rwot bene otim gin ma oneno ni ber.” <verse eid="2SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Kitmeno Joab ki jo ma gitye kwede ducu gurwayo cok kalweny ikom jo Ciria; ci jo Ciria guringo woko ki inyime. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Ka jo Ammon guneno jo Ciria guringo woko, ci gin bene gucako ringo woko ki inyim Abicai, gudonyo i taun. Ci Joab oa woko ki kalweny ikom jo Ammon, odok i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Ka jo Ciria guneno jo Icrael guloyogi, ci gucako coke kacel doki. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Ka Adadejer ocwalo kwena, ci gukelo jo Ciria ma gitye loka kulu Euprate; gucako bino i Kelam, kacel ki Cobak ma lawimony pa Adadejer ma en obedo latel wigi. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Ka kitito pirgi bot Daudi, ci en bene ocoko jo Icrael ducu. Ongolo kwedgi kulu Jordan, ka ocito wa i Kelam. Jo Ciria gurwayo mony ikom Daudi, ci gulwenyo ikome. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Ento jo Ciria gucako ringo woko ki inyim jo Icrael; Daudi oneko jo Ciria maromo ringo ki gadigadi lweny miya abiro, ki wegi aguragura alip pyere angwen. Gucobo bene Cobak lawimony pa jonu, ci en bene oto woko ki kunu. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Ka luker ma gubedo ite loc pa Adadejer guneno ni jo Icrael gutyeko loyogi woko, ci guketo lok pi kelo kuc ikin gi ki jo Icrael, dok gubedo ite locgi. Kitmeno jo Ciria gucako bedo ki lworo, pe dok gumede ki konyo jo Ammon.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi ki Batceba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 20:1">1 Tek 20:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I dog oro ma en aye kare ma luker gicito kwede kalweny, Daudi ocwalo Joab ki lutice ki jo Icrael ducu matye bote kamonyo jo Ammon, ci guneko jo Ammon malit, dok guyako pacogi woko, ka gurumu kwede taun me Raba, kun Daudi odong gire mere paco i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Inino mo acel i dyeceng abwora, ma Daudi oa malo ki i kabutune, ci en onongo tye kawot ki malo iwi ot pa rwot. Ka obolo wange cen ci oneno dako mo matye kalwok, kun kome nen mwonya tutwal. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Ci Daudi ocwalo dano mo me penyo wek eniang ikom dakonu. Ci ngat mo acel owaco ni, “Meno aye Batceba nya pa Eliam, ma dako pa Uria ma Lakit.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Daudi ocwalo lukwena mukene ni kiom dakonu, ci gucito gukele bot Daudi, ci Daudi obutu kwede. Ikare meno onongo dakoni pud olwoko kwer mone alwoka. I yo nge tim meno dakonu odok i ode. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Dakonu otugi gamo ic, ci ocwalo kwena me tito loke bot Daudi ni, “Dong atye ki remo.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Kitmeno Daudi ocwalo lok bot Joab, kun waco ni, “Cwala kong Uria ma jo Kit.” Ci Joab ocwalo Uria bot Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Ka Uria oo bote, Daudi openyo gin ma Joab tye katiyone, ki kit ma dano gubedo kwede kunu, ki kit ma mony tye kawot kwede. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Ka lacen Daudi owaco bot Uria ni, “Kong dong icit i odi, icit ilwok tyeni wek iywe manok.” Ka Uria okato woko ki i ot pa rwot, rwot dok ocwalo mot me cam olubu ki kore i pacone. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Ento Uria obutu inget dogola pa rwot kacel ki lutic pa ladite, ci en pe ocito i ode. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Ka kitito pire bot Daudi ni, “Uria pe omedo ki cito gire i ode,” Daudi owaco bot Uria ni, “In pe ia ki kawot ce? Ci pingo pe kong icito wa i odi?” <verse eid="2SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uria ogamo dog Daudi ni, “Canduk pa Lubangawa kombedi tye ibar lweny i bolo ki kunu ki mony pa jo Icrael ki Juda ducu gibedo woko, ki dong ladita Joab ki lutice bene ducu gitye gubutu woko i tim, ci bedo ber ka an aye doki acit i oda kuca ka cam ki ka mat ki kabedo ki dakona? Macalo itye makwoni, ki tipu komi tye makwo ni, pe atwero tiyo lok macalo meno.” <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Daudi owaco bot Uria ni, “Tin dok kong ibed kany, ci diki dong aweki icito.” Omiyo Uria dok obedo i Jerucalem inino meno, ki orwone bene. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi dok olwonge wek gicam kacel, ci Uria obino ocamo ka omato kongo inyime, ci Daudi omiyo en omer matek. I dyewor meno en dok ocito obutu i kabutune kacel ki lutic pa ladite; pe omedo ki cito i ode.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Daudi ocoyo waraga bot Joab i odiko, ci omiyo bot Uria me atera. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />I waraga meno Daudi ocoyo ni, “Ket Uria anyim kama lweny gwar iye, ci wujer, wudwog cen ki ingeye, wuweke kunu, wek gicobe kineke, wek en oto woko.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Ikare ma Joab oywako mony me rumu taun wek ema woko ki bot lumeroke, en otugi keto Uria kama en ngeyo ni oteka lweny pa lukwore gitye iye. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Jo ma i taun meno gubino gulwenyo matek ikom Joab, ci lutic pa Daudi mogo bene kinekogi woko. Ki Uria ma Lakit bene kineke woko iye. <verse eid="2SA 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Ci Joab ocwalo kwena otito bot Daudi gin ducu ma otime i dog lweny meno. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Joab ociko lakwena ma ocwalo bot Daudi kit man ni, “Ka dong ityeko tito bot rwot lok ducu mutime i dog lweny, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />kace ineno kiniga omako rwot ce openyi ni, ‘Pingo wunyiko cok wa ikom taun kalweny iye kunu? Pe onongo wungeyo ni kibicelowu ki malo iwi cel? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:53">Lung 9:53</ref></char></note> Anga mayam oneko Abimelek wod pa Jerubaal? Pe dako mo aye obayo lakidi rego madit ocele kwede ki malo iwi cel, omiyo en oto woko i Tebej? Pingo wunyiko cok ikom cel?’ Ka owaco kit man, ci in dok ibiwace ni, ‘Latici Uria ma Lakit bene oto woko.’”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Lakwena oa ocito, ci obino otito bot Daudi gin ducu ma Joab ocwale kwede. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Lakwena man dok otito bot Daudi ni, “Merok olwenyo ikomwa magwar, gucore ikomwa i dye bar, ento wajerogi, wadwokogi cen wa i dog cel me taun gi. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Ci wegi atero gucako celowa ki malo iwi cel, guneko lutici mogo woko; wa kadi latici Uria bene kineko woko.” <verse eid="2SA 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi ogamo dog lakwena man ni, “Ibiwaco bot Joab kit man ni, ‘Pe ibed ka paro lok meno, pien pala lucwan neko dano tungi ki tungi. Wek mony olweny matek ikom taun meno, ci imak woko, ci iret woko piny.’ Ci itite ni en myero oka lake matek.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Ka dako pa Uria owinyo ni kineko cware woko i dog lweny, ci en okok pi cware. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Ka kare me kwero colane dong otum, ci Daudi dok ocwalo kwena bote ci kikelo Batceba i ode, odoko dakone, onywalo kwede latin laco. Ento gin ma Daudi otimoni pe oyomo cwiny Rwot Lubanga.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Natan ojuku Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 51:4">Jab 51:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno Rwot ocwalo lanebi Natan bot Daudi, ci Natan ocito otito bote ni, “Yam tye jo aryo ma gibedo i taun mo, acel onongo lalonyo, ki acel lacan. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Lalonyo onongo tye ki lwak romi ki dyangi mapol; <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />ento lacan onongo obedo ki bwong romone acel loko ma en onongo owilo. Ci odongo ki i cinge kacel ki lutinone; romone ni obedo kacamo ngide came, kun mato pii i kikopone, dok butu abuta bene wa i kore, ci obedo macalo nyare. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Ikare ma lawot mo obino bot dano ma lalonyo ni, ci en pe oye kwanyo lime mo matye ikin romine kikome me tedo welone ma obino boteni, ento dok okwanyo romo pa dano ma lacan ni, en aye otedo pi welo ma obino boteni.” <verse eid="2SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Kiniga omako Daudi cut ikom lalonyo meno matek; ci owaco bot lanebi Natan ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwo ni, dano man ma otimo kitmeno ber kinek woko. <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Dok en biculu wang romo meno tyen angwen kulu, pien otimo gin marac kumeno, ki pe me bedo ki cwiny me kica ikom lacan ni.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Ci Natan cutcut owaco bot Daudi ni, “In aye i dano meno kikome. Ci dong iwiny dwon Rwot Lubanga, Lubanga pa Icrael tye ka waci ni, ‘Yam awiro in ki moo me bedo rwot maloyo Icrael. Dok alaro in ki i cing Caulo. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Ci amiyo ot pa laditi i cingi, wa ki mone ducu amiyogi i kori, dok amiyo boti ot pa Icrael ki pa Juda ducu. Kace meno ducu pud ibwonogi, kono nene amedi makato meno. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />In ityeko cayo lok pa Rwot, ki pi tiyo gin marac inyime pingo? Nen, ityeko neko Uria ma Lakit woko ki pala lucwan, ka dok ikwanyo dakone woko wek odok dakoni. Ma kun in aye ineko en ki pala lucwan pa jo Ammon. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />To me pala lucwan dong pe biweko odi, pien ityeko cayo an pi kwanyo dako pa Uria Lakit me bedo dakoni.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:22">2 Cam 16:22</ref></char></note>Rwot dok owaco kit man ni, ‘Nen, abimiyo gin marac poto ikomi ma bia ki i odi kikome; dok abikwanyo moni ki inyimi, ci amiyogi bot lawoti, ci en bibutu ki moni i dyeceng kamaleng. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />In itiyo meri i mung, ento an abitiyo man atyer inyim jo Icrael ducu, ki i dyeceng bene.’” <verse eid="2SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Daudi ogamo dog Natan ni, “An dong atiyo bal ikom Rwot Lubanga.” Ci Natan owaco bot Daudi ni, “Rwot gire dong otyeko jwayo bali woko, pe dong ibito. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Ento pi kit timi man nyutu atir ni ityeko cayo Rwot Lubanga marac adada; ci pi lok meno latini ma kinywaloni bito woko.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Lacen Natan odok i ode.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Latin pa Batceba oto</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Ci Rwot omiyo two ocelo latin ma dako pa Uria onywalo ki Daudi ni, ci two ne omede matek adada. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daudi obedo ka bako doge pi latin ni bot Rwot Lubanga wek okwo, kun rii kec benebene. Ikare meno ka odonyo i ot kabutune ci en butu piny i ngom dyewor ducu. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Ka ludongo ma i ode gubino me bite kun kicuku cwinye wek en oa malo kacam, ento en kwero woko, pe bene camo cam mo kwedgi. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Inino me abirone en aye latin oto woko. Lutic pa Daudi gulworo tito pi to pa latin, pien gutamo ni, “Ikare ma latin pud kwo waloko kwede kwe, pe owinyo dogwa. Ci watwero wace ningning ni latin dong otyeko to woko? Gwok nyo en bitime kekene marac.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Ento Daudi ka oneno lutice gitye kakwilo lok kacel, ci oniang ni latin dong oto woko. Ci en openyo lutice kuman ni, “Latin dong oto woko ce?” Ci gugamo doge ni, “En dong oto.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Ci Daudi ocako a malo ki i ngom, olwoke, owiro kome ki moo, ka oloko bongine bene. Okato woko ocito wa i Ot pa Rwot, oworo Lubanga; ka dok okato woko ocito wa i ode kikome. Ka openyo pi cam, ka guketo cam inyime ci ocamo. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Lutice guwaco bote ni, “Man kit gin ango ma itiyo, ladit? In ibedo ka rii kec ki kakoko pi latin ma onongo pud kwo; ento ka latin dong oto woko, ci dong ia malo icako camo cam!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Daudi ogamo ni, “Ikare ma latin pud tye makwo ni, abedo ka rii kec ki kakoko pi latin kun atamo ni, ‘Anga mono ma ngeyo ka nyo kica bimako Rwot ikoma, wek latin pe oto?’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Ento kombedi dong latin otyeko to woko; pud dok ari kec pingo kono? An dok atwero dwoko en cen bo? Wayi an aye dong abicito bote yo, ento en pe dok bidwogo bota.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomon kinywalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Daudi okweyo cwiny dakone Batceba, ci obutu kwede. Onywalo kwede latin laco, ocako nyinge Solomon. Rwot bene omaro latinu. <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />Rwot Lubanga dok ocwalo lanebi Natan bot Daudi ki lok man ni, ocako nying latin ni Jedidia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fk">Jedidia </char> obedo leb Ibru ma te loke gonye ni dano ma Rwot omaro.</note> pien Rwot maro.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi omako Raba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1 Tek 20:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Ikare meno Joab obedo kalweny ikom Raba, ma en taun madit pa jo Ammon, ci omako taun ma buku piine bene. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Ka dok ocwalo lukwena ne bot Daudi ka wace ni, “Abedo kalweny ikom taun madit me Raba, dok atyeko mako taun kama kibuku piine iye bene. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Ci ber in dong icok lwak mudongi kacel, ci ibin irum taun madit man wek imak woko, wek pe an aye amaki, miyo kibilwongo ki nyinga.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Kitmeno Daudi ocoko lwak kacel ci ocito kunu kwedgi i Raba, olwenyo ikome ci omako woko. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Daudi okwanyo lalukana me jabu ki iwi Milkom ma jok pa jo Ammon. Peke onongo romo cok kilo pyere adek, got me wel bene onongo tye iye, ci kicibo iwi Daudi. Daudi odwogo ki jami ma kiyako i taun maditi madwong tutwal. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Dok okelo dano ma kiyakogi ki i taun madit meno, oketogi katic ki mucumeno ki cururu nyonyo ki latong, ka dok oketogi katic matek me wango matapwali. Ci Daudi obedo katimo dano ma i taun pa jo Ammon kitmeno. Lacen Daudi ki lwak ducu gudok cen i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amnon gin ki Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Abcalom onongo tye ki lamine mamwonya mada ma nyinge Tamar. Ci Amnon wod pa Daudi ocako maro nyakonu. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amnon obedo ki miti madwong ikome; pi paro laminine Tamar ci ocako kwo calo ngat ma kome lit. Tamar onongo pud latin nyako ma peya ongeyo laco mo dok Amnon oneno ni pe etwero nongo yo mo me butu kwede. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Ento Amnon onongo tye ki lareme mo ma nyinge Jonadab, wod pa Cimea ma omin Daudi. Jonadab onongo tye dano mo ma langol ryeko tutwal. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />En openyo Amnon ni, “Wod pa rwot, gin ango mono do ma jonyo in jwijwi ni? Pe itita loke ce?” Amnon ogamo ni, “An amaro Tamar ma lamin omera Abcalom.” <verse eid="2SA 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Jonadab owaco bote ni, “But piny iwi kitandani, ci ipor ni two onongo odiyi matek. Ci ka woru Daudi obino ka limo twoni, ci ber iwace ni, ‘Wek lamera Tamar aye obin oyuba cam ka omiya ka wek acam, kun en biyubu ki inyima kany ma aneno, ka dok abicamo came ki i cinge.’” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Kitmeno Amnon ocako butu piny kun poro two. Ka rwot Daudi obino ka limo twone, ci Amnon olego rwot kun waco ni, “Alegi iwek lamera Tamar aye obin otede capat mogo aryo ki inyima, ka wek acam ki i cinge.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Daudi ocwalo lok paco bot Tamar kun waco ni, “Cit i ot pa omeru Amnon, wek iciyube cam ki kunu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Ma omiyo Tamar ocito wa i ot pa omine Amnon, ci otedo capat ki inyime. Ka dong otedo capate ocek, <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />ci otingo otakone oketo piny, oloko capati okelo ocibo inyim Amnon wek ocam. Ento Amnon okwero camo woko. Kadok owaco ni, “Kicwal dano weng woko ki inyima.” Kitmeno dano ducu gua gucito woko ki inyime. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Ka Amnon dok owaco bot Tamar ni, “Kela cama bota wa i tyelo bota kany, wek acak camone ki i cingi.” Tamar otero capat ma otedo ni ityelo bot omine Amnon. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Ento ka Tamar okele cam ityelo kama en tye iye kunu ci onyiko cok kwede wek en ocam ki i cinge, ci Amnon oa malo opoto ikome kun wace ni, “Bin wek ibut kweda do, lamera.” <verse eid="2SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamar ogamo doge ni, “Pe kumeno, omera, pe i maka tektek, pien kit tim macalo man peya otiine i Icrael kulu. Alegi pe itim tim me mingo kit man. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Ci an kono mono, abitero lakit lewici wa kwene? Ki in bene ibibedo ngat ma otimo tim me kipyeda i Icrael kulu. Dong alegi alega ni, icit ipeny rwot; en pe bikwero pi koma boti.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Ento Amnon pe owinyo loke; dok obedo ki teko makato nyakonu, ci omiyo omake ki tek, ka obutu kwede.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Lacen Amnon ocako kwero lamine Tamar ki kwer madit tutwal; dok okwero en ki kwer madit makato mar mayam omare kwede. Amnon dok owace ni, “Dong ikat woko iciti.” <verse eid="2SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Ento Tamar owace ni, “Pe kumeno, omera. Cwala woko tektek aye dok rac makato tim kipyeda madong itimo ikomani.” Amnon pe omedo ki winyo loke meno. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />En olwongo awobi mo ma tiyo bote macalo lakonye, ci owace ni, “Cwal dako ni woko ki inyima, ci irwak lalor dogola iceg woko ki i yo ngeye wek pe odony bota kany doki.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Ikare meno onongo Tamar oruku bongo ma labade bor, pien meno aye kit ruk pa anyira pa rwot ma peya gingeyo co. Latic pa Amnon ocwalo Tamar woko, ka oloro dogola ocego woko ki i yo ngeye. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Ci Tamar ocako onyo buru i wiye, ka oyeco bongo labade bor ma oruku ni, ma okwako wiye ki cinge, ka ocako cito kwede kun kok matek.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Ka Abcalom oneno lamine ci openye ni, “Omeru Amnon obutu kwedi ce? Kombedi dong ibed iling mot, lamera. En obedo omeru, pe cwinyi obed ka paro loke.” Ci Tamar obedo i gang bot Abcalom ki cwercwiny madwong kun bedo kene.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Ka rwot Daudi owinyo lok meno ducu, ci obedo ki kiniga madwong. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Ento Abcalom pe omedo ki loko lok mo bot Amnon maber nyo marac, kadi bed cwinye okwero Amnon matek pi mako lamine tektek.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abcalom oculu kwor pa Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Ka dong mwaka okato aryo, Abcalom obedo ki lunyar yer romine i Baal-kajor macok ki Epraim, ci olwongo awobe pa rwot ducu me bino iye. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />En ocito wa bot rwot Daudi kun wace ni, “Nen, atye ki lunyar yer romina. Alegi rwot in ki lutici wubin wuribe kacel kweda i karama man.” <verse eid="2SA 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Ento rwot owaco bot Abcalom ni, “Pe kumeno, latina, pe iwek wan ducu wacit kunu, miyo wacikeli peko nono.” Abcalom odiye ki tek, ento en pe oye cito kunu, kono olame gum keken. <verse eid="2SA 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Ci Abcalom dok owace ni, “Ka dong pe icito kweda, alegi iwek Amnon ma omera aye ocit kwedwa.” Ci Daudi ogamo doge ni, “Pingo imito ni en bene ocit kwedwu?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Ento ka Abcalom odiye ki tam, ci omiyo lacen en oweko Amnon ocito kwed Abcalom, ki lwak awobe pa rwot ducu.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abcalom dok ociko lutice ni. “Wunen maber ikare me kwer ka dong cwiny, Amnon odoko yom ki kongo bwino. Ci kace dong awaciwu ni ‘Wucob Amnon,’ ci dong wuneke woko kumeno. Pe wulwor iye gin mo, pien an aye acikowu. Wubed ma cwinywu nwang. Dok wubed twoni oteka lweny matego.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Ci lutic pa Abcalom guneko Amnon kit ma en ocikogi kwede. Cut awobe pa rwot mukene ducu gutware malo ki ngwec, ci ngat acel acel opye iwi kanane oringo kwede woko.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Lok okwongo o bot Daudi ma pud peya guo paco ni, “Abcalom oneko awobe pa rwot woko ducu liweng, ma acel mo bene pe obwot.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Rwot oa malo, ocako yeco bongine woko pi cwercwiny, ci obutu piny i ngom. Lutice ma gucung kangete bene guyeco bongigi woko. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Ento Jonadab wod pa Cimea omin Daudi, owaco ni, “Ladita, pe ibed ka tamo ni kineko lutino awobeni woko ducu. Amnon kene aye kineko. Kineko pi cik pa Abcalom, pien omoko lok man i cwinye cake ikare ma Amnon omako iye lamine Tamar obutu kwede tekteki. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Kombedi, rwoda rwot, pe ibed ka tamo ni awobeni ducu dong guto woko; Amnon kene aye oto.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Abcalom ki tung cel oringo woko. Ka awobi ma kuru piny otingo wange oneno piny, ci nen, lwak dano gibino ki i yoo ma a ki i Koronaim kun girabo nget got. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Jonadab dok owaco bot rwot ni, “Dong inen ba, lutino awobeni dong gitye kabino kit macalo awaci ni. Loka dong ocobo kakare.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Ka dong otyeko waco loke, ki ingeye cut, awobe pa rwot gutuc paco. Gucako dange ki koko, ci rwot bene wa ki lutice ducu gukok matek tutwal.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:3">2 Cam 3:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento Abcalom oringo woko, ocito bot Talmai wod pa Amikud, rwot me Gecur. Daudi obedo kakoko pi wode pi nino mapol! <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Kitmeno Abcalom oringo ocito i Gecur, obedo kunu mwaka adek. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Lacen ka cwiny rwot dong okwe pi to pa Amnon, cwinye ocako pide pi Abcalom.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Joab oyubu lok wek Abcalom odwog cen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Ikare meno, Joab wod pa Jeruya onongo dong otyeko niang maber ni cwiny rwot tye ka pide pi Abcalom. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Ci Joab ocwalo kwena i Tekoa kaomo dako mo ma laryeko matek matye kunu. Ka dakonu obino ci Joab owace ni, “Ber i por koko, dok iruk ginaruka me cola. Pe i wir komi ki moo, ento ibed macalo dako ma obedo kakoko lato pi kare malac. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Ka icit kwede wa bot rwot, ci icilok kwede kit man.” Kumeno Joab opiko dakonu ki lok.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Ka dako me Tekoa obino bot rwot, ci oryebe piny i ngom, omiye woro, kun wace ni, “Konya, ai rwot.” <verse eid="2SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Ci Daudi openye ni, “Gin ango matye ka yeli?” Dakonu ogamo ni, “Ada, an a dato ma cwara dong oto woko. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Onongo atye ki awobe aryo, ci ceng mo gubedo ka da keken gi i poto, ma latek kin gi obedo peke; ci ngat acel ogoyo wadi oneko woko. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Ci kaka ducu gutware gubino ikoma, gucako lok ni, ‘Kel dano ma ogoyo omine oneko wokoni, wek waneke woko.’ Nen, gimito neko laleyo woko, pi culu kwor pa omine. Kitmeno gimito neko dong ngat acel mudongi woko do, ci dong pe giweko gin mo pi nying cwara, en dong pe bibedo ki dano ne mo madong iwi lobo!”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Rwot ogamo dog dakonu ni, “Dok wa i odi, ci abicwalo cik ma mako lok komi.” <verse eid="2SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Dako me Tekoa dok owaco bot rwot ni, “Alii ne opot ikoma, ladita rwot, ki ikom ot pa wora. Wek alii mo pe opot ikom rwot ki ikom kom kere.” <verse eid="2SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Rwot dok owace ni, “Kace ngat mo owaci lok mo, ci ikel en bota, ci dong en pe bigudu komi matwal.” <verse eid="2SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Ci dakonu ogamo doge ni, “Ladit rwot, tim ber ikwonge i nying Rwot Lubangani, kun iwaco ni, lacul kwor remo pa lato owek neko woda obedi, wek latina man pe oto doki.” Ci rwot ogamo doge ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwo ni, yer wi wodi mo pe bipoto i ngom.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Dakonu dok owaco ni, “Alegi ni iwek dok alok lok mo acel keken boti, ladita rwot.” Ci Rwot ogame ni, “Waci.” <verse eid="2SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Dakonu ocako waco ni, “Pingo cwinyi oteri katiyo gin marac ikom lwak pa Lubanga? Pi kit ngolo kop ma ingolo ni omiyo in rwot ingolo kop ikomi bene keni ni kop oloyi, pien pe idwoko latini ma kiryemo ni woko paco. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Wan ducu wabito woko, wan wabedo calo pii ma okir piny i ngom, ma pe dok kitwero gurune kacel. Ento Lubanga pe twero kwanyo kwo pa ngat mo ma yenyo yo wek danone ma kiryemo pe kiryem obed woko kunu matwal. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />An abino kany kalok kwedi, ladita rwot pien dano gumiya lworo, omiyo atamo ni, ‘Abilok ki rwot; gwok rwot bitiyo iye gin mo ikom lok ma alego dok en bicobone bene. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Pien rwot biwinyo, ci bilaro latice ki i cing dano ma gimito jwayo an kacel ki woda woko ki i lobo ma Lubanga omiyo bot jone.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:27">2 Cam 19:27</ref></char></note>Dok onongo atamo ni, ‘Lok pa ladita rwot bimiyo cwinya kwe.’ Pien in, ladita rwot, irom ki lamalaika pa Lubanga ma poko kin lok maber ki marace. Rwot Lubangani obed kwedi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Ci rwot dok ogamo dog dakonu ni, “Pe imunga ilok ducu ma koni apenyi kwede.” Dakonu ogamo ni, “Lok loki bota ba, ladita rwot.” <verse eid="2SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Ci rwot openye ni, “Wun wuribo dogwu ki Joab ikom lok man ducu ce?” Ci dakonu ogamo doge kun waco ni, “I lok me adane, kit ma itye makwo ni, ladita rwot, dano mo pe twero kano loke tung acuc nyo tung acam ikom lok ma in rwot ipenyoni, latici Joab aye ociko an; en kikome aye oketo lok magi ducu idoga. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Latici Joab otimo man wek kong tam mo manyen obin ikomi. Ento in, ladita rwot, ryekoni rom ki ryeko pa lamalaika pa Lubanga, pien ingeyo gin ducu ma time iwi lobo ni.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Lacen rwot owaco bot Joab ni, “Nen ba, tin dong ajolo loki. Ber icit iom latina man Abcalom, idwok en paco.” <verse eid="2SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Ci Joab opoto oryebe piny wa i ngom omiyo woro bot rwot, ka olamo gum ikom rwot.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:22">Joab owaco ni, “Tin an latici dong angeyo ni ayomo cwinyi, ladita rwot, pien ityeko jolo gin ma alego ki boti.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Joab ocito i Gecur, ka oomo Abcalom ci okele paco i Jerucalem. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Ento rwot ociko ni, “Wek en kong obed ki cen i ode, pe obin inyima kany.” Ci Abcalom obedo gire ki cen i ode, pe omedo ki bino inyim rwot.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi otimo kica ki Abcalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />I karenu onongo pe tye ngat mo ma kiboro mwonyane makato Abcalom ki i lobo Icrael ducu; kome mwonya cake ki i tyene nio wa i cwiny dye wiye, kome ducu nen mwonya mada. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />En yam ngolo yer wiye i tum mwaka ducu; ka oneno ni yer wiye dong odoko pek, ci dong en ngolo woko. Kace olyelo yer wiye, en pimo ki mijan pa rwot, ci peke kato kilo aryo. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abcalom onongo tye ki lutino awobe ne adek ki nyako acel ma nyinge Tamar; nyakonu bene mwonya mada.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Abcalom obedo i Jerucalem pi mwaka aryo ma pe cito inyim rwot. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Lacen Abcalom ocwalo kwena bot Joab wek oter loke bot rwot, ento Joab pe omedo ki bino bote. Dok ocwalo kwena tyen me aryone, ento Joab dok pe omedo ki bino bote. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ka Abcalom oneno ni Joab pe tye ka mito bino bote, ci en owaco bot lutice ni, “Nen, poto pa Joab tye cok ki mera, ocoyo bel cayiri iye. Wucit wuwang woko.” Ci lutic pa Abcalom gucito guwango poto meno woko. <verse eid="2SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Ci Joab oa ocito wa bot Abcalom, odonyo i ode, ci openye ni, “Pingo lutici guwango potona woko?” <verse eid="2SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abcalom ogamo dog Joab ni, “Abedo ka cwalo lok boti ni ibin kany wek acwali bot rwot, wek ipenye ni, ‘Pingo en omiyo aa woko ki i Gecur? Kono nene abedo gira kunu.’ Kombedi dong amito icit inyim rwot. Ka roc mo tye ikoma, wek en oneka woko.” <verse eid="2SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Joab ocito bot rwot, ci otero loke, ci rwot olwongo Abcalom. Ci Abcalom ocito bot rwot, obino oryebe piny inyime, ci rwot ojole onoto leme.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Abcalom otemo mayo ker pa wone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />I nge meno Abcalom ocako nongo gadigadine ki aguragura me ywayone, ki dano pyere abic ma giringo inyime. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abcalom obedo ka a malo odiko con jwijwi, ci cung inget yoo i dogcel me Jerucalem. Ka oneno dano mo ma okelo lok me alara bot rwot, ci en lwongo danonu kun waco bote ni, “In ia ki i gang mene?” Kace dano meno owaco ni, “An aa ki i Icrael i kaka ma onyo,” <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />ci Abcalom dok waco bote ni, “Nen ba, loki nen mit dok tye atir, ento ngat mo pe tye ma rwot oketo ma biwinyo loki.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Abcalom dok waco ni, “Kono yam kiketo an aye abedo langolkop i loboni, kono ber tutwal! Kono ngat matye ki loke nyo pidone tugi bino bota cut, ci angole kop ma atir cut.” <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Ikare ducu ka dano mo obino ma ryebe piny me miye woro, ci en cwalo cinge kwako ki danonu, ci mote ki mot me mar. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Abcalom obedo katimo bot jo Icrael ducu kitmeno ka gubino ki pidogi bot rwot; ci oywayo cwiny jo Icrael ducu odwoko ikome.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />I agiki me mwaka me angwene, Abcalom openyo rwot ni, “Alegi wek acit i Kebron ka cobo kwonga mayam akwongo bot Rwot.” <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Pien yam akwongo kwong, ladit ikare ma abedo i Gecur i lobo Ciria kun awaco ni, “Ka Rwot odwoka tuwa i Jerucalem ada, ci abicito i Kebron kamiye woro.” <verse eid="2SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Ci rwot ogamo doge ni, “Ber icit giri ki kuc.” Ci Abcalom oa ocito i Kebron. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Ento Abcalom ocwalo lukwena ne imung ci guwoto gurumu i kaka pa jo Icrael ducu, kun en ociko ni, “Ka teke wuwinyo dwon tum okok, ci wubiwaco ni, ‘Abcalom dong odoko rwot i Kebron!’” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Abcalom ocito ki dano ma gua ki i Jerucalem ma giromo miya aryo ma en olwongogi macalo welene i Kebron. Gin ducu gucito ata ma pe gungeyo tere. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Ikare ma Abcalom tye katyero gitum, en ocwalo kwena wek kilwonge Akitopel ma jo Gilo, ma lamitam pa Daudi, ci en oa ki i ganggi ma i Gilo ci obino. Ci piro lokgi omede ameda matek, lwak gubedo ka mede bot Abcalom ameda.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Lakwena mo obino bot Daudi ma owace ni, “Cwiny jo Icrael odak woko ka lubu kor Abcalom.” <verse eid="2SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Daudi owaco bot jone ducu ma onongo gitye kwede i Jerucalem ni, “Wutugi a wek waringu woko. Ka pe wun orune wacito woko oyoto, ci dano mo pe ma bibwot ki i cing Abcalom, miyo en bipoto ikomwa, ci bikelo can madwong ikomwa. En bineko dano ma i taun madit man tyeko woko ki pala lucwan.” <verse eid="2SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Ci lutic pa rwot guwaco bote ni, “Nen ba, wan lutici watye ka kuru gin ducu ma in imoko.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Ci rwot ocito woko ki jone matye i ode ducu ma gulubu kore, ento en oweko mon angeca ma giromo apar ka gwoko ot. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Rwot oa woko ki lwake ma lubu kore; ci ocung cok ki ot me agikine. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Lutice ducu gumol gukato ki inyime; ki jo Keret ducu, ki jo Pelet ducu ki jo Gat miya abicel mayam gulubu kore nia ki i Gat; gin ducu gumol gukato ki inyim rwot.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Ci rwot owaco bot Itayi, dano me Gat ni, “Pingo in bene icito kweda? Dok cen icibed ki rwot manyen; pien in larok ma ia woko ki i lobowu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Pud ibino abina laworo maca, ci bedo ber ka an tin dok amiyi ibed kawire kamal ata kwedwa? Nen ba, an abiwoto kama pe angeyo. Dok cen, ikwany omegiwu gudok kwedi. Myero Rwot Lubanga omii mare ma pe loke, ma gene, obed ikomwu.” <verse eid="2SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Ento Itayi odok iye bot rwot ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwoni, dok macalo in rwot bene itye makwo ni, ikabedo ducu ma ibibedo iye, ladita, kadi bed i to kadi bed i kwo, an bene abibedo kunu kwedi.” <verse eid="2SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Ci Daudi owaco bot Itayi ni, “Dong ikat wacit kacel.” Ci Itayi ma dano me Gat okato kacel ki dul monye ducu ki mon wa lutinogi matino ma gitye bote ducu. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Dano ducu gubedo kakoko matek ikare ma jo pa Daudi gikato ki ka ngetgi. Rwot ongolo ki i laora kulu Kidron, ci lwak ducu gukato gukemo tung tim.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Ka Abiatar obino, ci Jadok bene otugi bino ki jo Levi ducu, ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike pa Lubanga. Gin guketo Canduk me Gicike piny, nio ka lwak ducu gumol ki i taun madit, gukato woko. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Ci rwot owaco bot Jadok ni, “Ting Canduk me Gicike, idwok cen i taun madit. Kace alimo gum ki bot Rwot, ci abidwogo paco dok aneno kome ki kama en bedo iye. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Ento ka Rwot Lubanga owaco ni pe etye ki yomcwiny mo ikoma, ci nena, an dong atye ene, wek en dong otim ikoma gin ducu ma en neno ni ber ki tung bote.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Ci rwot dok owaco bot ajwaka Jadok ni, “Nen ba, wudok i taun madit, wun ki Abiatar ki awobewu aryo, Akimaj ma wodi ki Yonacan wod pa Abiatar. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Abikuru ki i wang wat ma i tim, nio kalok bia ki botwu ma miya ngec mogo.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Kitmeno Jadok ki Abiatar gutingo Canduk me Gicike, gudok kwede cen i Jerucalem, ci gubedo kunu.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Ento Daudi ocako ito malo iwi got Jeituni. Kun en ito malo ki koko, ki tyene bene onongo tye nono, ma oumu wiye; ki jo ma gitye kwede ducu guumu wigi, ma giwoto kun gikok matek. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Ka dok kitito bot Daudi ni, “Akitopel bene tye ikin lupir lok gin ki Abcalom,” ci Daudi olego Rwot Lubanga ni, “Ai Rwot, alegi imii tam ma Akitopel miyo obed lok me mingming.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Daudi oito malo, oo wa iwi got kama kiworo iye Lubanga. Ci nen, Kucai ma La-arki otuc, obino ka rwate kwede ma kanyine oyec woko, ki ma ojuku wiye ki ngom. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daudi owace ni, “In ka iwoto kweda ibimiya peko. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Ento ber idok i taun madit ci iwac bot Abcalom ni ibibedo latice, kit mayam ibedo latica ikare ma an abedo rwot. Ci in aye ibibalo tam ma Akitopel miyo bote. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Jadok ki Abiatar ma ajwaki pa Lubanga bene gibibedo kwedi kunu. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Awobegi aryo bene gitye kunu, Akimaj wod pa Jadok ki Yonacan wod pa Abiatar. Ci ibicwala lok ducu ma iwinyo wok ki botgi.” <verse eid="2SA 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Kitmeno Kucai ma larem Daudi obino i Jerucalem ikare ma Abcalom donyo kwede i taun madit.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi gin ki Jiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 9:9-10">2 Cam 9:9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka Daudi okato cwiny wi got manok, ci nen Jiba latic pa Mepibocet orwate kwede kun tye ki kana aryo ma kitweyo kom me bedo i wigi, dok guyeyo mugati miya aryo, tuga olok mutwo miya acel, nyig yat ma ocek i oro miya acel ki opiru kongo bwino acel. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Rwot openyo Jiba ni, “Ikelo jamini me ngo?” Jiba ogamo ni, “Akelo kana pi konyo jo ma i odi, rwot, wek gubed i wigi me wotgi, ki mugati me acama pa awobeni, ki kongo bwino me amata pa jo ma komgi oloc i tim.” <verse eid="2SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:26-27">2 Cam 19:26-27</ref></char></note>Rwot dok openye ni, “Latin pa laditi Caulo tye kwene?” Jiba ogamo dog rwot ni, “‘Aweko en tye odong i Jerucalem; pien en tye ka tamo ni, tin dong jo me ot pa Icrael gibidwoko ker pa wone i cinge.’” <verse eid="2SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Ci rwot owaco bot Jiba ni, “Nen ba, jami mayam pa Mepibocet ducu tin dong gudoko meri.” Jiba ogamo ni. “An dong apoto aryebe piny inyimi, wek amede ki nongo gum inyimi, ladita rwot.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi gin ki Cimei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Ka rwot oo i Bakurim, ci laco mo obino bote, en obedo dano mo ma i ot pa Caulo. Nyinge Cimei wod pa Gera. En owoto obino karwate ki Daudi kun ceno Daudi mede kwede ameda, <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />kun celo Daudi ki gotgu, wa lutic pa rwot ducu, ki lwak jo ducu, ma gin twoni oteka lweny ducu ma gitye inget Daudi tung lacuc ki tung lacam. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Cimei obedo ka ceno dano kun waci, “Wot icit, wot icit, in lao remoni, in dano ma kite peke! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Rwot dong oculu kwor ikomi pi oyo remo i ot pa Caulo ma koni itye kaloc makakare. Rwot dong otingo ker omiyo woko i cing wodi Abcalom. Nen ka topiny dong opoto ikomi, pien in i dano ma lao remo.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Abicai wod oteka lweny ma mine Jeruya owaco bot rwot ni, “Pingo iweko gwok ma oto ni bedo ka ceni, ladita rwot? Wek akat ikome acit angol wiye woko.” <verse eid="2SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Ento rwot ogamo ni, “An alaro ango kwedwu, wun awobe pa Jeruya? Kace en tye ka ceno an ma onongo Rwot aye ocike ni, ‘Cit icen Daudi,’ ci anga madok biwaco ni, ‘Pingo itimo kitmeno?’” <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Daudi dok owaco bot Abicai ki lutice ducu ni, “Nen ba, woda aye mito neka, ci Labenjamin man pe dong bimito neka makato? Wuwek en obedi, wek obed ka cena gire, pien Rwot aye ocike. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Gwok nyo Rwot aye bineno kit atwom man matye ikoma, ci Rwot aye bicula ki gin maber maka cen ma gicena kwede tin.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Kitmeno Daudi ki lwake gulubu yoo gucito gigi; kun kono Cimei woto rabo nget got ma woto pore ki Daudi, kun woto ki cene kwede, ka bayo got celo kikome bene, ki onyo apwagu bene ikome. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Rwot Daudi ki jo ducu ma gitye kwede guwoto guo wa i dog kulu Jordan ma guol matek, ci rwot ki jone guywe ikom ologi ki kenyo.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abcalom i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Abcalom ki lwake ducu, ma gin jo Icrael, gubino gucore i Jerucalem kacel ki Akitopel. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Ka Kucai ma La-arki, ma larem Daudi, obino bot Abcalom, ci Kucai owaco bot Abcalom ni, “Rwot obed kwo nakanaka. Rwot obed kwo nakanaka!” <verse eid="2SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Ci Abcalom owaco bot Kucai ni, “Meno aye yo me nyutu mar bot laremi bo? Pingo pe in icito kacel ki laremi?” <verse eid="2SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Kucai owaco bot Abcalom ni, “Pe kumeno, pien ka ngat ma Rwot Lubanga ki lwak man kacel ki jo Icrael ducu gutyeko yerone, an abibedo danone dok abibedo kwede bene. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />An dok abitiyo bot anga mono? Pe myero abed bot wode kikome? Kit mayam abedo katic bot woruni, abitic boti bene kitmeno.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Abcalom dok owaco bot Akitopel ni, “Ngola ryeko ba; dong wa oo wa kany wabitimo gin ango doki?” <verse eid="2SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ci Akitopel owaco bot Abcalom ni, “Dong ia itugi cito wa bot mon angeca pa woru, ma en owekogi ka gwoko otti wek ibut kwedgi. Ci jo Icrael ducu ka gibiwinyo piri ni, in dong i doko lamerok pa woru, miyo jo ducu ma gitye tung boti komgi biyare woko ki tek.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:11-12">2 Cam 12:11-12</ref></char></note>Kitmeno kiguru kema pi Abcalom malo iwi ot, ci Abcalom ocako donyo iwi mon angeca pa wone me butu kwedgi ma jo Icrael ducu gineno.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Ikare meno tam ducu ma Akitopel miyo nen calo lok pa Lubanga kikome. Tam me ryeko ma Akitopel miyo nen ber kitmeno bot Daudi wa bot Abcalom bene.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Kucai obalo miyo tam me ryeko pa Akitopel woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Akitopel dok owaco bot Abcalom ni, “Wek ayer dano alip apar wiye aryo, wek an kikoma acak wot me lubu kor Daudi tin i dyewor. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Abio bote manongo pud ool woko, ma tame bene goro; wek atugi bango kome woko, ci jo ma gitye bote ducu gibiringo woko. Ci abineko en rwot keken, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />ci abidwoko lwak ducu boti, macalo nyako ger ma bino paco bot cware. Mite ni kinek ngat acel keken, ci jo mukene ducu gibibedo labongo atwom mo.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Tam meno me ryeko oyomo cwiny Abcalom ki ludongo pa jo Icrael ma gitye ducu.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Ci Abcalom dok owaco ni, “Wulwonga Kucai La-arki bene, wek wawinyu bene gin ma en biwacone.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Ka kilwongo Kucai, obino bot Abcalom, ci Abcalom owace ni, “Akitopel owaco kuman dok kuman, dong wabitic ki kit tameni? Kace pe, ci in iwaci.” <verse eid="2SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Kucai owaco bot Abcalom ni, “Tam ma Akitopel okeloni pe ber.” <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Kucai dok omede ki loke ni, “In ingeyo maber ni, woru ki jone ducu gin oyita lulweny ma gitego, gin gitwoni ma lugero magwa, macalo nguu ma ger pi lutinone ka kimako i tim. Dok pud amedo ni, woru oyita lweny, en pe twero butu ki lwak kacel i dyewor. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Nen ba, kadi wa kombedini en tye mukane woko i bur kakene, nyo ikabedo mo kunu. Ci kace owinye ni joni mogo kinekogi woko ki i lweny mukwongoni, ka dong dano mo owinyo biwaco ni, kibedo kaneko dano ma gubedo kalubu kor Abcalom. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Ci kadi bed dano mo yam oteka lweny, ma cwinye nwang macalo cwiny labwor, cwiny me lworo bimiyo kome to woko lirut; pien jo Icrael ducu gingeyo ni woru tye oyita lweny, ki jone ma gitye bote ducu gin oteka lweny. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Ento an amiyo tama kit man ni, wek jo Icrael ducu gucoke boti, cake ki i Dan nio wa i Beer-ceba, wek gubed mapol marom ki kweyo ma i dog nam, in kikomi bene icit kwedgi kalweny. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Kitmeno miyo wabipoto ikome ki i kabedo mo ma kome binonge iye, ci wabicore ikome macalo toyo ma poto luk i ngom, ci en kikome ki jo ducu ma gitye kwede ngat mo acel i kin gi pe bibwot. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Kidong kace oringo woko odonyo i taun mo, ci jo Icrael ducu kibikelo tol girumu ki taun meno, ka gicako ywayo gicoro woko piny wa i nota; kadi wa kidi lalinglinge mo pe kibinongo mudong kunu.” <verse eid="2SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Ci Abcalom ki lwak ducu ma i Icrael gugamo ni, “Tam ma Kucai La-arki omiyoni aye ber makato pa Akitopel.” Pien onongo Rwot yam dong oketo ni, kibibalo te tam pa Akitopel woko ducu kadi bed ber tutwal, ka wek Rwot oket can mapek ikom Abcalom.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucai omiyo ngec bot Daudi ci en obwot woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Lacen Kucai dok otito lok bot ajwaka Jadok ki Abiatar ni, “Akitopel onongo omiyo tam me ryeko bot Abcalom ki ludongo pa jo Icrael kuman; ki an bene dok amiyo tama kuman. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Kombedi dong wucwal kwena oyotoyot bot Daudi wucit otite ni, tin pe dok obut i wang wat ma i tim, ento oa woko oyoto okat wa loka ca, wek pe mony omak rwot ki jo ma en tye kwedgi onekgi woko ducu.” <verse eid="2SA 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Ikare meno onongo Yonacan ki Akimaj gubedo ka kuru lok i En-rogel. Kunu angeca mo wire iye jwijwi katero lok botgi, ka kikwango loke kitero kitito bot Daudi; ento gigwoke matek wek komgi pe onen ka gidonyo i taun. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Ento latin awobi mo wange ocob ikomgi ci onenogi, ocito otito pirgi bot Abcalom. Ci gin aryo ducu gurune gucito i paco pa dano mo ma i Bakurim ma onongo tye ki wang ite i dyekale, ci gudonyo gulute iye. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Dako pa laconu otingo laum dog wang it opeto oumu ki wiye, ka okelo kal omoyo i wiye; kun pe tye dano mo ma ongeyo. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Ka lutic pa Abcalom gubino ci gudonyo i gang meno bot dakonu, ci gupenye ni, “Akimaj ki Yonacan gitye kwene?” Dakonu owaco botgi ni, “Dong gutyeko kato nota ora ma pii tye iyeni woko.” Ka gubedo kayenyo korgi ci pe gumedo ki nongogi, lacen gudok woko cen i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Ka jonu dong gucito woko, ci Akimaj ki Yonacan gukato woko ki i wang it, gucito gutito lok ducu bot rwot Daudi. Guwaco bote ni, “A woko ki kany oyot wek ingol kulu ikat loka ca; pien Akitopel aye omiyo tame kit man kun miyo tame pi timo rac ikomi.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Daudi otugi a malo cut, kacel ki lwak ducu ma gitye kwede, ci gungolo loka kulu Jordan. Me o kwarpiny onongo pe tye dano acel mo ma odong ma pe ongolo loka kulu Jordan.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ka Akitopel oneno ni tame me ryekoni pe giye lubune, otweyo kom bedo iwi kanane, oito i wiye oringo kwede i gange. Ka oyubu ode ducu maber, ci ocito odene woko, ci oto woko cut, kiyiko i lyel pa wone.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi obedo i Makanaim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Daudi ocito i Makanaim, ci Abcalom ongolo loka kulu Jordan kacel ki jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Ikare meno onongo Abcalom oketo Amaca aye dok obedo ladit ma lawimony ma ka Joab. Amaca aye wod pa laco mo ma nyinge Itra ma La-icmael, ma onyomo Abigal nya pa Nakac, ma lamin Jeruya ma min Joab. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Jo Icrael kacel ki Abcalom gugony i lobo Gilead.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Ka Daudi obino i Makanaim, ci Cobi wod pa Nakac me taun madit Raba, gang pa jo Ammon, ki Makir wod pa Amiel ma ganggi Lo-debar, ki Bangilai ma jo Gilead ma ganggi Rogelim, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />gukelo kitanda butu mapol, ki becengu, agulugu, ngano bel cayiri, moko kwon, bel ma gicelo, muranga ki ngorgu, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />moo kic, cak lukulu, romi, cak mutwo ma kiyubu ki cak dyang, ci gumiyo bot Daudi ki lwake wek gucam, pien gutamo ni kec obedo kaneko lwak, omiyo komgi oloc woko, ki orwo pii bene onekogi i tim.<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">To pa Abcalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daudi ongiyo lwak monye matye bote, ka ocako keto ludito ma giloyo wi mony pi dano alip ki pi dano miya. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Ci dong ocwalo monye okato woko, dul acel me adek obedo ite twero pa Joab, dul acel me adek ite twero pa Abicai wod pa Jeruya ma omin Joab, ki dul acel me adek ite twero pa Itayi dano me Gat. Ci rwot owaco bot jone ni, “An kikoma bene abicito kacel kwedwu.” <verse eid="2SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Ento dano ducu gugamo ni, “Pe ibikato icito kwedwa. Pien ka waringo woko, ci gin pe gibiparo pirwa; kadi bed nucu dano oto, pe giparo pirwa. Ento in kikomi aye piri tek marom ki pi jo alip apar; pieno myero ibed ka cwalowa kony ma a ki i taun madit man botwa.” <verse eid="2SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Rwot Daudi owaco botgi ni, “Gin ducu ma wuneno ni ber en aye abitiyo.” Kitmeno rwot ocung inget dog gang kun lumonye ducu gimol gikato ki i dulgi, jo me miya ki miya ki jo me alip ki alip. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Ka rwot dok ociko Joab ki Abicai ki Itayi ni, “Macalo an a wone, awaco ni, wutim ber ki latin awobinu, en Abcalom.” Ci lwak ducu guwinyo ka rwot ociko ludito wi mony pi Abcalom.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Kitmeno mony okato woko me cito i tim kalweny ki jo Icrael; ci gucako lweny ki i bunga me Epraim. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Lumony pa Daudi guloyo jo Icrael, ci neko dano obedo madit inino meno; guneko dano maromo alip pyere aryo kulu. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Lweny oromo i lobo ducu, ci wel dano ma oto pi jami matye i bunga kato ma kineko ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Ka lweny odoko lyet Abcalom ocako ringo woko ci otugi rwate ki lumony pa Daudi, kun en tye kangwec ki kanane, ci kana oringo ocore kwede wa ite kworo madit ma jange oluk ocule woko liking. Wi Abcalom orwake omoko woko ikin jang kworo, ci kana oweke kun lyere ikin polo ki ngom, kana ma en oito i wiye ni obedo ka mede ki ngwec. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Ka dano mo acel ikin orobo pa Daudi onene ci otito pire bot Joab ni, “Nen, aneno Abcalom tye ka lyere malo iwi yat kworo.” <verse eid="2SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Ci Joab owaco bot dano ma otite loki ni, “Iwaco ni ngo? Ineno kome? Ci pingo pe icobo ireto woko piny i ngom? Kono itimo kumeno, kono cwinya obedo yom ikomi, onongo abimiyo mot boti maromo dul ryal apar, ki del pyer bene.” <verse eid="2SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Ento laconu odok iye bot Joab ni, “Kadi iting dul ryal ma peke alip acel kulu wek imii i cinga, pe abitwero tingo cinga aketo ikom wod pa rwot. Wan bene wawinyo ka rwot ciko in ki Abicai ki Itayi ni, ‘Macalo an a wone, awaco ni wugwok latin awobinu en Abcalom.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Dok bene ka nene atimo tim bwami mo ce aneke woko, (kun kono pe tye gin mo ma rwot pe ngeyo), kadi in kikomi bene nongo ibiwene woko ki iye.” <verse eid="2SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Ci Joab ogamo doge ni, “Pe abibalo kare marom man kalok kwedi.” Ci okwanyo tong adek i cinge, ocito ocobo ki kor Abcalom i adunune ki tonge adek ducu, ma onongo en tye kalyere iwi kworo makwo. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Lacen awobe apar ma gin luting jami lweny pa Joab gubino gurumu Abcalom ci gucube guneke woko.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Ka Joab okutu tum, ci mony ducu gudwogo woko cen ki ka ryemo kor jo Icrael; pien Joab dong ojukugi woko. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Gutingo kom Abcalom gubolo ite bur mo matut ma i bunga, ka guyweko lwak godi madwong gutoro i wiye. Ci jo Icrael guket woko ata, kun dano acel acel dok i gangigi.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Onongo Abcalom yam ocibo wir got ocung i Nota pa rwot, pien obedo kawaco ni, “An pe atye ki woda mo me po pi nyinga.” Ci en ocako nying wir meno ki nyinge kene, ci pud kilwongo ni got me ni po pa Abcalom nio wa onyo.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi okumu pi to pa Abcalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Akimaj wod pa Jadok owaco ni, “Wek aring ater lok bot rwot, acit awace ni, ‘Rwot dong otyeko lari ki i cing lumeroki.’” <verse eid="2SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Joab ogamo ni, “Pe ibitero lok tin. Ibitero inino mukene, ento tin pe ibitero lok mo, pien wod pa rwot aye dong oto woko.” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ci Joab owaco bot dano mo me lobo Kuc ni, “Ring icit itit bot rwot gin madong ineno.” Lakuc okulu wiye inyim Joab, ka lacen ocako ngwec. <verse eid="2SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Akimaj wod pa Jadok dok olego Joab ni, “Gin ma mito time myero otime ikoma, ento wek an bene aring i kor Lakuc.” Joab ogamo doge ni, “Imito ringo kunu pingo ce, latina? Nen, pe ibinongo iye mot mo pi tero lok man.” <verse eid="2SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Akimaj dok owaco ni, “Gin ma mito time myero otime ikoma, ento an bene abiringo.” Ci Joab owace ni, “Ring do.” Ci Akimaj ocako ringo i kora yoo ma i yoo bar, ci okato Lakuc woko ki ngwec.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Ikare meno onongo Daudi obedo piny ikin dog gang me iye ki ma wokoni, kun lakur piny onongo oito malo iwi ot ma iwi dog gang, macok ki cel ma orumu gangi. Ka lakur piny otingo wange cen kaneno piny, ci oneno dano mo ka ringo bino en kene. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Lakur piny odange kun waco bot rwot. Ci rwot odoke iye ni, “Kace en tye kene, ci tye ki lok ma okelo.” Dano ca omede ki ngwec bino kwede cok. <verse eid="2SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Lakur piny dok oneno dano mukene ka ringo bino. Ci odange bot dano ma i dog gang ni, “Dano mukene dok tye kabino ki ngwec, en kene!” Rwot owaco ni, “En bene obikelo lok mo.” <verse eid="2SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Lakur piny dok owaco ni, “Atamo ni, langwec ma otelo yoni nen calo Akimaj wod pa Jadok.” Ci rwot owaco ni, “En dano maber, en obibino ki lok mabeco.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Akimaj odange matek ni, “Rwot, piny tye maber.” Ci okulu wiye piny inyim rwot ma en oryebe kwede piny i ngom kun waco ni, “Pwoc obed bot Rwot Lubangani, madong olari woko ki i cing dano ma gutingo cinggi kalweny ikomi, ladita rwot.” <verse eid="2SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Rwot Daudi dok openye ni, “Lok mo marac pe ikom awobina Abcalom?” Ci Akimaj ogamo ni, “Ikare ma Joab cwala ki lok, awinyo woo madwong ki i yo ngeya, ento pe dong aniang i gin ma otimeni.” <verse eid="2SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Ka rwot owaco bote ni, “Kong iloke icung ki kenyo.” Ci oloke ocung mot.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Nen, Lakuc bene obino, ci otugi waco ni, “Akelo lok maber bot ladita rwot! Pien Rwot Lubanga otyeko lari ki i tek pa jo ducu ma onongo gutingo lweny ikomi.” <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Ci rwot dok openyo Lakuc ni, “Lok mo pe marac ikom latina Abcalom?” Lakuc ogamo ni, “Lumeroki ki jo ducu ma gutinge kalweny ikomi maraci myero gubed macalo latin awobi ni, ladita rwot.” <verse eid="2SA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Ci cut cwiny rwot opoto lirim, ci oa malo oito malo i kicika matye i ot ma iwi dog gang, ci ocako koko kun woto kwede, ma koko wode ni, “A woda Abcalom, woda Abcalom! Kono nene an aye ato ma kakari do! Oii Abcalom, woda, woda do!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Joab ojuku Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Kitito bot Joab ni rwot tye kakumu ki koko malit pi to pa Abcalom. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Kitmeno loyo lweny me ninonu otugi loke odoko me kumu pa lwak monye ducu, pien guwinyo inino meno ni, “Cwiny rwot tye ka cwer kun ton pi wode ma oto i dog lwenyi.” <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Ci dano ducu gubedo macalo jo ma mony aye oryemogi, pien dong gikwale akwala ka gidonyo kwede i taun madit ki lewic madit inino meno. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Rwot Daudi oumu wange woko ki cinge lirit, ma obedo piny kakoko ki dwon malongo ni, “Ai woda Abcalom, ai Abcalom, woda, woda do!” <verse eid="2SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Ka Joab obino ci odonyo i ot bot rwot Daudi, ci owaco bote ni, “In tin iweko lewic omako lutici ducu, ma gin aye jo ma tin gularo kwoni, ki kwo pa awobeni ki anyirani, ki kwo pa moni ki mon angecani ducu. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />In kara imaro jo ma dag wangi do, dok idag jo ma gimari. Tin dong inyutu woko kamaleng ni, ludito wi monyi ki lutici ducu pe gitye ki kony mo boti. Tin dong aniang atir ni, kono nene Abcalom aye obwot makwo, kun wan ducu wato woko, kono gire tin cwinyi obedo yom makato. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Ber ia malo kombedi, ikat woko wek icit ilok ki lutici lok ducu mabeco, pien akwonge boti ki nying Rwot ni, ka pe in iye kato woko, ci pe dok dano mo bidong boti tin i dyewor man me o i rupiny; dok man aye gin ma bibedo rac boti makato can madongo ma ilimo ducu cake ki i ka tinoni nio kwede wa onyo.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Rwot otugi a malo cut, ocito obedo i kabedone ma i dog taun madit. Ci kitito bot lwak ducu ni, “Nen, rwot tye obedo dong i dog taun madit.” Ci dano ducu gubino inyim rwot.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2SA 19:8">Daudi odwogo cen i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Inino meno onongo jo Icrael guringo woko ducu, kun dano acel acel odok gire i gangigi. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Dano ducu gubedo kaleyo tam ki ikin kaka ma i Icrael ducu, kun gilokoni, “Rwot Daudi aye yam pe olarowa ki i cing lumerokwa, dok en aye bene olarowa ki i cing jo Piliciti. I kareni en dong oringo oweko lobowa pi lworo Abcalom. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Ento Abcalom mayam wawiro ki moo wek olowa ni bene dong kineko woko ki i mony. Ci pingo pe dong kong kiloko iye lok mo kombedi pi dwoko rwot Daudi paco?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Ka lok ma jo Icrael ducu gubedo kawacone oo bot rwot Daudi, ci en ocwalo kwena bot Jadok ki ajwaka Abiatar kun waco ni, “Wuwac bot ludongo pa jo Juda ni, ‘Pingo wun aye wudong cen ka kidwoko rwot paco i ode? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Nen, wun aye utmega kikome, wun aye wucogo na ki ringo koma; ci pingo wun aye dok wudong cen ka kidwoko rwot paco?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Dok wuwac bot Amaca ni, ‘In giri ibedo wata. Lubanga myero oket can ikoma kumeno ki makato, ka pe aketo in aye idoko ladit maloyo monya maka Joab, cake tin cito kwede anyim.’” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Kumeno omiyo dano ducu ma i Juda gumoko ikom Daudi ki cwiny acel, ci gucwalo lok bote ni, “Dong idwog cen, in kacel ki lutici ducu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Ma omiyo rwot ocako dwogo cen oo i kulu Jordan. Ci jo Juda gubino i Gilgal ka jolo wiye ki ka dwoko rwotgi cen loka kulu Jordan.<verse eid="2SA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 16:5-13">2 Cam 16:5-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cimei wod pa Gera, ma jo Benjamin, dano me Bakurim, en bene orune obino kacel ki jo Juda kajolo rwot Daudi, <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />kun bino ki jo Benjamin maromo alip acel. Ki Jiba, ma latic maloyo ot pa Caulo, ki awobene bene apar wiye abic, ki lutice pyere aryo, gin bene gucore i kulu Jordan ci gutuc inyim rwot. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Gukato ki iwang wat pi kelo dano pa rwot loka kulu, ki pi tiyo gin ducu ma rwot mito.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2SA 19:18">Daudi otimo kica bot Cimei</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Ka Cimei wod pa Gera obino, ci en opoto piny inyim rwot ikare ma rwot dong mito ngolo loka Jordan. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Ci en owaco bot rwot ni, “Rwot, pe imak bala i cwinyi, pe dok ibed ka po ikom gin mayam atimo ikomi marac, ladita rwot, ikare ma ia kwede ki i Jerucalem. Dong pe iket loke kulu i cwinyi. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />An latici angeyo maber ni atimo bal. Pieno, nen an dong tin abino, dok an aye akwongo bino ki ikin dano me ot pa Yucepu kajoli.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Abicai wod pa Jeruya ogamo doge ni, “Pe omyero kinek Cimei woko pi lok magi, pien yam en obedo kaceno dano ma Rwot aye owiro?” <verse eid="2SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Ento Daudi ogame ni, “Gin ango ma alaro kwedwu, wun awobe pa Jeruya, ma wun bene tin wuloke wudoko lumeroka bo? Tin dok kibineko dano ikin jo Icrael? Tin aye dong aniang atir ni, an a rwot maloyo jo Icrael.” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Ci rwot dok owaco ni, “In Cimei pe ibito.” Ci okwonge kwong ma moko loke.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 9:1-13">2 Cam 9:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref></char>
    </note>Mepibocet wod pa Caulo bene obino kajolo rwot. Ci obino ma pe ongolo lwet tyenegu, dok pe okido yer tike, pe bene ojwero wek obed maleng, pe olwoko wa bongine cake ki ikare ma rwot oringo kwede nio ikare me dwogone ki kuc. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Ka en oa ki i Jerucalem obino kajolo rwot, ci rwot openye ni, “Mepibocet, pingo yam pe icito kweda?” <verse eid="2SA 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mepibocet ogamo ni, “Ladita, latica aye obwola. Onongo awaco bote ni, ‘Twena kom bedo iwi kanana, wek abed iye, acit kacel ki rwot.’ Pien tyena ongol woko. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />En ocoko lok me goba ikoma owaco boti, ladita rwot. Ento in icalo lamalaika pa Lubanga, ma omiyo in i tim gin ma ineno ni ber. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Onongo yam jo ma i ot pa wora ducu kwogi okemo to keken ki inyimi, ento in iketa ikin dano ma gicamo iwi mejani. Dong kit gin ango ma myero dok akok iye boti?” <verse eid="2SA 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Rwot ogamo doge ni, “Pingo ibedo ka tita lok ikomi tutwal? An dong atyeko ngolo atir ni, wun ki Jiba wubipoko lobo pa Caulo.” <verse eid="2SA 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Ci Mepibocet owaco ni, “Rwot, ka kumeno keken, ci wek en oter ducu, macalo in ladita rwot dong idwogo paco ki kuc.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi onyutu cwiny maber ikom Barjilai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">2 Cam 17:27-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note> I karenu Barjilai ma Lagilead bene obino ma oa ki i Rogelim; ci olwoko rwot oo kwede i dog kulu Jordan, wek engol kwede loka tungcel. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Barjilai onongo dong otii woko, mwaka me dite dong romo pyere aboro. En aye yam obedo kamiyo cam bot rwot ikare ma rwot tye i Makanaim, pien onongo en lalonyo mada. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Ci rwot owaco bot Barjilai, “Bin wakat kwedi loka ca, abigwoki i Jerucalem.” <verse eid="2SA 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Ci Barjilai owaco bot rwot ni, “An pud adong ki mwaka adi me bedo na wi lobo, mamiyo dok acito wa i Jerucalem? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Ikare man an dita dong romo mwaka pyere aboro. An pud dok atwero poko kin gin ma yomo cwinya nyo ma pe yomo cwinya? Pud dok abilo mit pa cam ma acamo, nyo gin ma amato? An pud dok atwero winyo wer ma co nyo mon giwero? Ci lok ango mamiyo amedo peko ikomi, ladita rwot? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Abinywako yoo kwedi manok me lwoki nio ka ingolo loka kulu Jordan. Dok pingo icula ki mot macalo meno? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Dong alego ni, wek adok cen i ganga, acit ato ki kunu, inget lyel pa wora ki pa maa. Ento atye kany ki latici Kimkam; wek en aye ocit ongol kwedi kulu, ci icitim en kit ma ineno ni ber.” <verse eid="2SA 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Rwot ogamo doge ni, “Kimkam biwot kweda loka ca, ci abitimo ki en kit ma ineno ni ber tung boti; ki gin ducu ma imito ki tung bota abitiyone piri.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Ka lwak ducu gungolo Jordan, ci rwot bene ongolo. Lacen rwot ociko Barjilai ki mot me mar, ka dong olame gum; ci Barjilai odok i pacone.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo Juda ki jo Icrael gupyem pi rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Rwot ocito i Gilgal, ki Kimkam bene onywako wot kwede. Ki lwak ma i Juda ducu ki nucu jo Icrael bene gunywako wot kacel ki rwot. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Jo Icrael ducu gubino bot rwot, ci guwaco bote ni, “Pingo utmegiwa ma i Juda gukwalo in rwot woko akwala, kacel ki jo ma i odi ducu, ci gukelowu loka kulu Jordan in Daudi ki lwaki ducu?” <verse eid="2SA 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Lwak ma i Juda gugamo dog jo Icrael ni, “Pien rwot aye watwa macok, ci pingo kiniga makowu ikom lok macalo man. Onongo dong wacamo cing rwot bo? Nyo en dong otyeko miyowa mot mo bo?” <verse eid="2SA 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Jo Icrael dok gudok iye bot jo Juda ni, “Wan watye ki dul apar ite ker man, ki ite loc pa Daudi wan wadwong wakatowu. Ci pingo wun aye dok wucayowa? Pe myero nene wan aye wakwong waco pi dwoko rwot paco?” Ento jo pa Juda lokgi obedo gwa makato lok pa jo Icrael.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ceba ojemo ikom Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:16">1 Luk 12:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 10:16">2 Tek 10:16</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare meno onongo tye dano mo marac mada ma nyinge Ceba wod pa Bikri ma Labenjamin. En ocako kutu tum kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Wan pe watye ki wang pokwa mo ikom Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">pe watye ki dul mo ikom latin pa Yece;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">wun jo Icrael, dano acel acel odok i kemane!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Kitmeno jo Icrael gutware gua woko guweko Daudi, ci gucako lubu kor Ceba wod pa Bikri. Ento jo Juda gire gubedo kalubu kor rwotgi ma cwinygi omoko ikome likang, cake ki i Jordan o kwede i Jerucalem.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 16:22">2 Cam 16:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka Daudi oo i ode ma i Jerucalem, en okwanyo mon angecane ca apar ma onongo owekogi ka gwoko odeni, ci oketogi i ot ma kigwokogi iye kun en miyo botgi cam, ento pe omedo ki butu kwedgi macalo mone. Kitmeno kiloro wigi woko i ot nio wa ikare me togi, kun gibedo macalo mon to.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Ci rwot dok owaco bot Amaca ni, “A icit ilwong jo ma i Juda ducu gubin bota ikine ka nino maromo adeki, ci in kikomi bene ber ibed tye kany.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Amaca ocito kalwongo jo ma i Juda, ento en odike okato nino ma kicikoni woko. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Ci Daudi owaco bot Abicai ni, “Ceba wod pa Bikri bitimowa marac tutwal ma bikato Abcalom. Cit ki danona enu wutugi ryemo kore, wek pe omaa taun mogo ma gicelo ki gogo, miyo en bikelo ki wan ayela madwong.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Jo ma gulubu kor Abicai obedo Joab ki jo Keret ki jo Pelet, ki twoni oteka lweny ducu. Ci gin gucito kun gua ki i Jerucalem pi ryemo kor Ceba wod pa Bikri. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Ka dong guo i got mo madit ma i Gibeon, ci Amaca otuc ikomgi. Onongo Joab oruke ki bongo me acikari, kun otweyo del pala lucwan ipyere, ma orwako pala lucwan i akurane. Ka Joab woto bino anyim tung bot Amaca, ci palane opoto piny. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Joab openyo Amaca ni, “Itye maber bo, omera?” Ka Joab omako yer tik Amaca ki cinge ma lacuc ka mote kun noto leme. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Ento Amaca pe oneno ni pala mo onongo tye i cing Joab. Joab ocobo i Amaca, ci cin iye owuke piny; ci Joab pe dok onwoyo cobone tyen me aryo, ci Amaca oto woko cut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Ci Joab ki omine Abicai guryemo kor Ceba wod pa Bikri. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Dano pa Joab mo ocung kanget Amaca ci owaco ni, “Ngat ma cwinye omaro Joab, ki ma cwinye tye ikom Daudi, olub kor Joab.” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amaca obutu kun pwode ngene kwede piny i remone inget gudu. Tek dano mo oo kenyo, ka oneno Amaca, ci kong cung. Ka dano pa Joab oneno ni lwak ducu kong gicung, ci en obino otingo kom Amaca woko ki i gudu otero i lum, ci obolo bongo mo oumu ikome. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Ka dong kikwanyo kome woko ki i gudu ci lwak gucako mol kun gilubu kor Joab pi ryemo kor Ceba wod pa Bikri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Ceba ocito kun obaro kin kaka ducu ma i Icrael ma kumalo nio wa i Abel ma inget Bet-maaka; ci jo ma i ot pa Bikri ducu gucoke bote, kun gin gilubu tame. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Ci jo ducu ma gulubu kor Joab gucito gurumu taun madit ma Ceba tye iye, en Abel ma inget Bet-maaka. Gucako toro cel lobo orumu taun madit meno woko, cel meno kitoro otene wa ikom cel gogo me taun madit. Dok gubedo katwomo cel me taun madit meno me amuka woko. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Dako mo ma laryeko odange ki i taun maditi ni “Wuwiny ya! Wuwiny ya! Wuwac bot Joab kong obin kany, wek kong alok kwede mono.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Joab ocito cok bote ci dakonu openyo ni, “In aye Joab bo?” Ci en ogamo ni, “An do.” Dakonu owace ni, “Kong iwiny loka, ladit.” Ci Joab ogamo doge ni, “Atye ka winyone.” <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Dakonu dok owaco ni, “Carolok macon waco ni, ‘Wek gupeny dog jo Abel;’ miyo giyubu lok tum mupye. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />An angat acel ikom jo ma gimito kuc, ki jo ma lugen i Icrael. Ci in imito balo taun madit man woko ma en aye mego i Icrael kulu; pingo ityeko lwak pa Rwot woko?” <verse eid="2SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Ci Joab ogamo ni, “Pe kumeno gire, pe kumeno; pe abino ka tyeko taun madit nyo ka balone woko. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Lok meno pe ada. Ento dano mo ma i lobo godi me Epraim ma kilwongo Ceba wod pa Bikri aye otingo cinge ikom rwot Daudi. Wumii ki wan en keken, ci abia aweko taunwu maditi woko.” Dakonu odok iye bot Joab ni, “Nen ba, kibiboli wiye wok ki iwi cel botwu.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Ka dakonu ocito bot jonu ducu ki ryekone. Ci gungolo wi Ceba wod pa Bikri woko, ci gubolo woko bot Joab. Cut Joab okutu tum, ci mony ocako ket woko me weko taun madit meno, kun dano acel acel dok i pacone kikome. Ki Joab bene odok i Jerucalem bot rwot.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludito pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />I karenu onongo Joab aye ladit maloyo mony pa jo Icrael ducu; ki Benaya wod pa Yekoyada aye loyo jo Keret ki jo Pelet. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoram aye onongo ladit maloyo tic muroni; ki Yekocapat wod pa Akilud onongo en obedo laco lok ma time. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Ceva obedo karan me otkot, ki Jadok ki Abiatar gubedo ajwaki pa Lubanga; <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />ki Ira ma jo Jair obedo ajwaka pa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Culu kwor pa jo Gibeon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Kec opoto ikare me loc pa Daudi ma kun obedo katime mwaka ki mwaka pi mwaka adek kulu. Man omiyo Daudi openyo dog Rwot iye, ci Rwot owace ni, “Tye pi alii me remo ikom lok ma Caulo ki jo me i ode gutimo, pien en oweko kineko jo Gibeon.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:3-15">Yoc 9:3-15</ref></char></note> Ci rwot olwongo jo Gibeon ni kong gubin bote. (Jo Gibeon pe gin jo Icrael kikome, ento gin gubedo jo Amor mayam odong. Onongo yam jo Icrael gukwongo kwong bot Rwot ni pe kibinekogi, ento kadi bed kumeno, Caulo otemo nekogi wek etyekgi woko, pien nyeko omake pi jo Icrael ki jo Juda.) <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Daudi openyo jo Gibeon ni, “Gin ango ma myero atim pirwu? Dok abiculu kwor meno ikit yo ango, ka wek dong wulam gum ikom lwak pa Rwot?” <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Jo Gibeon gugamo dog rwot ni, “Lok ma ikinwa ki Caulo ki jo me ode pe lok ma gitwero tyekone ki culu lim, kadi wa wan bene pe myero wanek iye dano mo acel ma i Icrael.” Ci Daudi ogamo ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">“Wun dong wuwaco ni atimo ki wun kit gin ango?” <verse eid="2SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Guwaco bot rwot ni, “Dano ma obedo ka nekowa, ma en aye oyubu pi tyekowa woko wek pe wabed ki kabedo mo i lobo ma Icrael loyoni, <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />wek kimii botwa awobene abiro, wek wagurgi woko gungabe malo inyim Rwot ki i Gibeon ikom got pa Rwot.” Ci rwot ogamo ni, “Abimiyogi.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 20:15-17">1 Cam 20:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 9:1-7">2 Cam 9:1-7</ref></char>
    </note>Ento rwot ongoyo Mepibocet wod pa Yonacan wod pa Caulo oweko en odong, pien yam gukwongo kwong inyim Rwot matye ikin gi, en Daudi ki Yonacan wod pa Caulo. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:19">1 Cam 18:19</ref></char></note>Rwot okwanyo awobe aryo ma min gi nyinge Rijpa nya pa Aiya, ma en onywalogi ki Caulo, nyinggi Armoni ki Mepibocet; ki awobe abic pa Merab ma nya pa Caulo, ma en onywalo ki Adriel wod pa Barjilai ma jo Mekola. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Ci en omiyogi ducu i cing jo Gibeon, ci gugurugi gungabogi malo iwi got inyim Rwot. Gin abiro ducu guto woko lawangacel. Kinekogi inino ma kicako kayo iye kac, inino ma kicako kayo iye bel cayiri.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Ka Rijpa nya pa Aiya okwanyo bongo cola, oyaro iwi got me butune, ci orii kunu cake i acaki kayo kac nio ka kot ocako cwer ikomgi ki i polo. En pe oweko winyo mo opye ikomgi i dyeceng, kadi wa nguu mo pe oo ikomgi i dyewor. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Ka kitito bot Daudi kit gin ma dako angeca pa Caulo, Rijpa nya pa Aiya, obedo katimone, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:8-13">1 Cam 31:8-13</ref></char></note> ci Daudi ocito okwanyo cogo pa Caulo ki pa Yonacan ki bot jo Jabec-gilead, mayam onongo gukwalo komgi ki i dye gang me Bet-can kama yam Lupiliciti gungabogi malo ikare ma Lupiliciti guneko iye Caulo iwi got Gilboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Daudi okwanyo cogo pa Caulo ki pa wode Yonacan otero, ka gucoko cogo pa jo abiro ma kigurogi ni bene. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Ci guyiko cogo pa Caulo ki pa wode Yonacan i lobo Benjamin i Jela, i lyel pa wone Kic; ci gutiyo gucobo kit ma rwot ociko ducu. Ka lacen Lubanga dong ocako winyo lega pa Luicrael ma gilego pi lobogi.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abicai olaro Daudi ki i cing twon oyita lweny</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Tek 20:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />“Jo Piliciti dok gubedo kalweny ki jo Icrael, ci Daudi ocito kunu kacel ki jone, gucako lweny ki jo Piliciti. Ikare ma Daudi ocako ol woko, <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />ka Icbibenob ma ngat acel ikin likwayo pa twoni olumani pa lupiliciti obino ikom Daudi kun otamo ni etwero neke woko kun tye ki tonge ma peke romo cokcok kilo adek kulu, dok otweyo del pyere matye iye pala lucwan manyen. Ci en oa otire, ikom Daudi wek dong eneke woko.” <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Luk 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:17">Jab 132:17</ref></char></note>Ento Abicai wod pa Jeruya omwome oringo kalare ci ocubu lapiliciti ni oneko woko. I nge meno jo pa Daudi gucike i nying Rwot ni, “In pe dok ibibino kacel kwedwa imony mo, miyo ibineko mac tara pa jo Icrael woko.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo pa Daudi guneko oteka lweny</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Tek 20:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Ka lacen, lweny dok ocake ikom jo Piliciti ma i Gob; ci Cibekai ma Lakucat oneko Cap woko ma ngat acel ikin likwayo pa twoni olumani. <verse eid="2SA 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Kalweny dok ocake ikom Lupiliciti ma i Gob, ci Elkanan wod pa Jair, ma jo Beterekem, oneko omin Goliac ma jo Gat, ma bol tonge rom ki rii yat me cweyo bongo. <verse eid="2SA 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Lweny dok obedo i Gat kama tye iye dano mo ma odongo mabor liwau, matye ki nyig cinge abicel, ki nyig tyene bene abicel, tung ryoryo ducu, omiyo nyig lwete ducu romo pyere aryo wiye angwen. En bene obedo lakwar twoni olumanu. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Ka en okati kanywaro jo Icrael ki ngalane, ci Yonacan wod pa Cimei ma omin Daudi oneke woko. <verse eid="2SA 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Gin jo angwen meno ducu gubedo likwayo pa twoni oluma mayam bedo i Gat. Gin ducu Daudi ki jone gutyekogi woko.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Wer me wayu pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 18">Jab 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Daudi owero wer man bot Rwot Lubanga ikare ma Rwot olare iye ki i cing lumeroke ducu, wa ki i cing Caulo bene. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Ci en owero kit man ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">“Rwot aye gota, en cel gogona matek, en lalara.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />En Lubangana, ki gota, aringo alaro bote;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">en gwoka macalo kwot, en kalarena matek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">en gang gogona kama aringo alaro iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">en lalara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">in aye ilara ki i lweny magwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Akok bot Rwot, ci en olara ki i cing lukwora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:4">Pimeno myero kipak Rwot.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Biamwonyi me to otwage oruma woko dyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:5">kulu ma piine ger ma neko dano ocore woko iwiya limuk.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Tol lyel odwala woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:6">ki owic me to bene orine woko inyima.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Ikare ma atye ki can akok bot Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">akok gira bot Lubangana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Ci Rwot owinyo dwona ki i Ot mere maleng, kokona pi kony odonyo i ite.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Cutcut lobo oyenge ma more pe twere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:8">te godi ducu bene guyenge ma kun giyenge matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:8">pien kiniga onongo omako Lubanga.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Yito oduny okati ki i ume,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:9">ki mac ma wang malyet okati ki idoge ma lodine bene olyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:9">dok olyel matek mada.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Rwot oyaro polo ka obaro iye, ci olor obino piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:10">kun bene piny macol mapek orume ma ocido olyane oryene ite tyene.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Oito iwi lakerubi ci otuk kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:11">kome onen i dye yamo,<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />ci oketo piny macol orume woko dyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:12">kemane obedo pol mapek mupong ki pii.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Lodi mac ma lyel okati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:13">onen i piny maryeny maleng ki inyime.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Rwot omiyo polo omor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:14">ci dwon Ngat Mamalo Twal owinye.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Ci Rwot obayo aterone, okeyo lumerok woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:15">omiyo obayo aterone owil calo lutkot, ci owek wigi onywene guket atata.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Dye nam opoke, pete tere onen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">guti me te lobo bene odong twolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">ikare ma Rwot ojukugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">ki ikare ma okutugi ki yamo me yweyone ma okati ki i ume me gero.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Rwot ocwalo cinge piny ki i polo, ci omaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:17">oywaya okela woko ki i pii matut.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />En olara ki i cing lukwora matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:18">olara ki i cing jo ma gidaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:18">pien onongo gitek mada giloya woko.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Gupoto ikoma ikare ma can dong obwoya matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:19">ento Rwot aye obedo ka konya.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />En olara woko ki ican ma atye iye ci okela ikabedo malac;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:20">olara pien onongo ni ayomo cwinye.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />Rwot omiya pwoc pien oneno ni kita atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:21">ocula ma oporo lengcwinya;<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />pien abedo kalubu cik pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:22">pe apoke woko ki bot Lubanga pi bal mo.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Alubu cike ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:23">pe angak aweko gin ma en ociko.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Pe atimo bal mo inyime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:24">dok agwoke mada pe me timo bal alii mo.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Ma omiyo Rwot omiya mot pien oneno ni kita atir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:25">En ocula ma oporo lengcwinya ma abedo kwede inyime.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Rwot, in lagen bot jo ma lugen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:26">ki bot ngat maber ma pe ki bal, in inyute bote bene calo ngat maber ma pe ki bal.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Cwinyi leng ikom jo ma cwinygi leng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:27">ento iger ikom dano ma tame ogom.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Ilaro jo mamwol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:28">ento jo ma luwake idwokogi woko piny.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Eyo, in aye ibedo mac tarana, ai Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:29">Lubangana aye menyo an i colpiny.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Eyo, atwero tyeko buca mony kulu ka in ikonya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:30">pi teko pa Lubangana miyo apye akalo wi cel.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Lubanga man, gin ducu ma en tiyo tye atir gire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">dok lok pa Rwot ma en cike me tiyo bedo ada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">en tye macalo kwot pi jo ducu ma giringo gilaro bote.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Anga ma Lubanga, kono Rwot kene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:32">Anga ma gota, pe Lubangawa aye keken gire?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Lubanga man aye kalarena matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:33">en aye ma omiyo awoto ki kuc.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 3:19">Kab 3:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Oketo tyena obedo macalo tyen til,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:34">ociba malo kama acung iye matek.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />En pwonyo cinga pi lweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:35">ma omiyo atwero gomo wa atum mola.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Dong ityeko miya kwot me lari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:36">kony ma in imiya en aye omiyo adoko dit.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Imiya yoo malac kama awoto iye ducu kadi lukwora pe gutwero maka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:37">omiyo tyena pe ocer ikare ma alwenyo.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Aryemo kor lukwora ci anekogi woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:38">pe aloke adok cen nio ka atyekogi ducu.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Atyekogi woko, acubugi woko pil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:39">ci gupoto piny ka tyena; pe dong gutwero a malo.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />In aye iruka ki tek pi lweny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:40">imiyo lulweny ikoma guto gutum woko ka tyena.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Imiyo lumeroka guringo woko ki inyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:41">imiyo atyeko jo ma gidaga woko.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Guciko wangi, ento ngat mo pe ma olarogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:42">gukok bot Rwot, ento en pe ogamo doggi.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Adinogi woko gudoko macalo apwa me ngom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:43">abologi woko macalo coto matye i yoo gudugu.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Yam ilara ki ikom rok mapol ma gilwenyo kweda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">iketa abedo ladit maloyo rok ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">jo mayam pe angeyogi gudoko jona ma an aye aloyogi.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Lurok gubino bota ma gimwole amwola;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:45">cutcut ka giwinyo pira ci gilubu cika.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Ci tek cwiny orwenyo woko ki botgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:46">gua ki kama gukane iye gubino ma komgi myel amyela.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />Rwot tye kwo; kipak gota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:47">kipil wi Lubanga ma en lalara.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />En Lubanga ma omiya aculu kwor ikom lukwora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:48">dok ma obwoyo rok mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:48">omiyo gubedo ite loca;<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />ci olara ki i cing lumeroka.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 22:49" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">In ipilo wiya makato lukwora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">ilara ki i cing lulweny ma lubwami.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:9">Rom 15:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pimeno abikori ikin lurok, ai Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:50">dok abiwero wer me pako nyingi.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Lubanga miyo deyo me loc bot rwot mere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:51">dok nyutu mar mere ma pe loke ikom danone ma en oyero ka kiwiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:51">bot Daudi ki likwaye ducu matwal.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Daudi me agikine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Man aye lok ma Daudi oloko me agikine:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:1">Lok pa Daudi wod pa Yece, lok pa dano ma gipilo wiye tutwal, dano ma Lubanga pa Yakobo owiro, lawer jabuli mamit i Icrael.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“Cwiny pa Rwot aye miyo aloko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:2">loke winye ki ileba.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Lubanga pa Icrael oloko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">Lubanga ma obedo got matek pa Icrael owaca ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Ka dano mo loyo lwak maber, kun loyo ma lworo Lubanga,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />deyone nen ikomgi macalo ceng maryeny i odiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">macalo ceng maryeny odiko ma nongo pol pe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">dok bedo calo kot ma twiyo lum ki i ngom.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Eyo, oda pe ocung kitmeno kacel ki Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Pien otyeko keto gicike kweda ma bedo nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">ma oyubu kikore, dok bigwoko maber.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">En bimiyo gin ma konya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">ki gin ma amito mede ameda.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Ento jo ma pe gilworo Lubanga ducu gicalo okutu ma kibolo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:6">ma dano pe twero mako ki cinge nono.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Dano ma gudu komgi makogi ki nyonyo nyo bol tong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:7">ci mac aye wangogi tyeko woko.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Twoni oteka lweny pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1 Tek 11:10-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Magi aye nying twoni oteka lweny mayam gibedo bot Daudi: Joceb-bacebet ma jo Takemon, en aye ladit pa “jo adeki.” En yam okato ki tonge ikom dano miya aboro ci onekogi woko ducu lawangacel.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Ngat ma lubu en ki ikin twoni oteka lwenye adeki aye Eleajar wod pa Dodo ma jo Akoki. En obedo kacel ki Daudi ikare ma guywayo mony ikom jo Piliciti ma gucoke kalweny kunu, ci jo Icrael guringo gujer ki ngegi. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Ci en Eleajar ocako neko jo Piliciti nio wang ma cinge ojony omoko ikom pala lucwane. Rwot omiyo ki gin loc madit tutwal inino meno. Lacen jo Icrael gudwogo cen kalubu kore, ento gubino pi lunyu jami ki ginarukagu ki ikom dano ma kinekogi keken.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Twon oteka lweny ma olube aye Cama wod pa Agee ma jo Karar. Ikare ca jo Piliciti dok gucoke kacel i Leki kama poto ngor tye iye, ci mony pa jo Icrael dok guringo woko ki inyim jo Piliciti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Ento Cama aye ocamo co, ci obino ocung i dye poto ngor pi larone, ka ocako neko jo Piliciti, ci Rwot dok omiyo loc madit tutwal tung bot jone.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Ikare ma gikayo kac jo adek ki ikin jo pyere adeki gucako wot, ci gucito bot Daudi i boro got matye i Adulam; onongo buca mony pa jo Piliciti ogony i nota Repaim. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Ikare nu onongo Daudi tye i kakanene, dok cel gogo pa lumony pa jo Piliciti onongo tye i Beterekem. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daudi dok oloko ki miti madwong ni, “Kono ngat mo ocito ka twomo pii amata ki iwang it me Beterekem matye cok ki dog gang ca, wek omiya amati, kono ber mada!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Ci twoni oteka lweny adeku gucito gubaro dye gony pa jo Piliciti, ci gutwomo pii ki iwang it me Beterekem matye cok ki dog gang ci gukelo bot Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:16">Ento Daudi pe omedo ki mato; ento otingo ci oliyo inyim Rwot pi gityer amata, <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />kun waco ni, “Pe kumeno, ai Rwot. An pe myero atim kit man. An dok amat remo pa dano ma gudyero komgini?” En aye lok ma omiyo pe omato piinu. Twoni oteka lweny adeku yam gutimo kitmeno.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abicai omin Joab, wod pa Jeruya, onongo en ladit ikin jo pyere adeki. Ci en otingo tonge olwenyo ikom jo miya adek ci onekogi woko ducu, ma omiyo nyinge oywek ma mito romo ki pa jo adek ca. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Pieno en olimo yweka madit makato ki ikom jo pyere adeki, ci odoko ladit me wi monygi; ento pe en olimo rwom pa jo adek ca.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya wod pa Yekoyada obedo twon oteka ma i Kabjeel, latim tim madito. En oneko awobe aryo ma gin twoni labwor me Moab. En bene olor odonyo i bur ci oneko iye labwor ikare ma pee ocwer mapek. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Ka dok oneko Laejipt mo, ma dano mamwonya. Laejipt meno onongo tye ki tonge i cinge, ento en Benaya ocito bote ki odoone, ci oyutu tong woko ki i cing Laejipt, ka oneke kwede woko ki tongenu. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Benaya wod pa Yekoyada otiyo gin madito kitmeno, omiyo nyinge olimo yweka madit ma mito rom ki twoni oteka lweny adeki. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Ci nyinge oywek ikin jo pyere adeki, ento pe olimo rwom pa jo adek ca, ci Daudi oketo obedo ladit pa jo ma gwoko rwot.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Acael ma omin Joab bene yam tye ikin jo pyere adeki; ki Elkanan wod pa Dodo me Beterekem, <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Cama me Karod, Elika me Karod, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Kelej ma jo Palti, Ira wod pa Ikec me Tekoa, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiejer me Anatot, Mebunai ma Lakucat, <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Jalmon ma jo Akoki, Makarai me Netopa, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Keleb wod pa Baana me Netopa, Itayi wod pa Ribai me Gibea pa jo Benjamin, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya me Piraton, Kidai ma bedo i nota ora me Gaac, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abialbon me Arba, Ajimavet me Bakurim, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliaba me Caalbon ma wod pa Jacen, Yonacan, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Cama ma jo Karar, Akiam wod pa Carar ma jo Karar, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elipelet wod pa Akacbai me Maaka, Eliam wod pa Akitopel me Gilo, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Kejero me Karmel, Parai ma jo Arbi, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igal wod pa Natan me Joba, Bani ma jo Gad, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Jelek ma jo Ammon, Nakarai me Beerot, ma lating jami lweny pa Joab wod pa Jeruya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ira ma jo Itri, Gareb ma jo Itri ki Uria ma jo Kit.<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />Gin ducu twoni oteka lweny pyere adek wiye abiro.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okwano wel jo Icrael ki Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1 Tek 21:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Kiniga dok omako Rwot ikom jo Icrael, ci opiyo Daudi ikomgi kun owace ni; “Cit ikwan wel jo Icrael ki Juda.” <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Kitmeno Daudi owaco bot Joab ki ludito wi mony ducu ma gitye bote ni, “Wucit ka kwano dano ikin kaka ducu ma i Icrael, cake ki i Dan nio kwede wa i Beer-ceba, kun wukwano dano ducu.” <verse eid="2SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Ento Joab ojuku rwot kun owace ni, “Myero Rwot Lubangani aye omed wel lwaki tyen miya kulu, kun in rwot ineno ki wangi, ento pingo cwinyi mito ni ikwan dano kit man, ladita rwot?” <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Ento lok pa rwot obedo tek makato pa Joab ki pa ludito wi monye ducu, omiyo Joab ki ludito wi mony gukato woko ki inyim rwot, ci gucito ka kwano wel jo Icrael. <verse eid="2SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Ka gungolo loka kulu Jordan, ci gucako kwano wel dano cake ki i Aroer ki i taun matye i dye nota, ci gukemo Gad, guo kwede wa i Jajer. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Ka gumede kiwoto wotgi wa i Gilead ki i Kadec ma i lobo pa jo Kit; ka guo kwede wa i Dan, ci guloke gudok tung Cidon, <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />ka gumede kwede wa i taun me cel gogo me Turo ki i taun gi ducu pa jo Kiv ki jo Kanaan; ka dok gucito kwede i Negeb me Juda kun giwok ki i Beer-ceba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Ka gurumu i lobo ducu, ci guo kwede i Jerucalem ma onongo dong otero dwe abongwen ki nino pyere aryo. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Ka Joab omiyo wel dano ma en okwanoni bot rwot, ci gunongo i Icrael tye iye oteka lweny ma wegi pala lucwan alip miya aboro, ki i Juda giromo alip miya abic.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Ka Daudi okwano wel dano otum, ci cwinye ocako poto. Ci Daudi obako doge bot Rwot kun waco ni, “Abalo twon bal man maditi pi gin ma dong atimo inyimi. Ento, ai Rwot, kombedi dong alegi ni ikwany roc man woko ki ikoma, pien atimo lok me mingo tutwal.” <verse eid="2SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Ka dong Daudi oa malo odiko con, ci lok pa Rwot obino bot lanebi Gad, ma lanenpiny ma konyo Daudi. Rwot owace ni, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Cit iwac bot Daudi ni, ‘Rwot owaco kuman ni, abimiyi lok adek; in ikwany acel ki ikin gi wek amii opot ikomi.’” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Kitmeno Gad obino bot Daudi, otite lok meno kun wace ni, “Imito kec aye opot i lobowu otyek mwaka adek? Nyo imito lumerok guryemwu wek wuring inyimgi pi dwe adek kulu? Nyo two gemo aye opot i lobowu otyek nino adek? Ci in kong itam wek inong kit ma abidok iye bot Rwot ma ocwala botini, ka wek adwoke lok meno.” <verse eid="2SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Daudi owaco bot Gad ni, “An dong adonyo i twon can madit ma pe wace. Wek wapot i cing Rwot, pien kicane dwong; ento pe apot i cing dano.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Ci Rwot ocwalo two gemo opoto ikom jo Icrael cake odiko nio kwede inino ma ocikoni. Dano guto cake ki i Dan o kwede wa i Beer-ceba maromo alip pyere abiro kulu. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Ikare ma lamalaika pa Rwot matye kaneko dano oryeyo cinge okemo Jerucalem wek etyek woko, ci Rwot ongut ikom gin man marac. Ojuku lamalaika kun waco ni, “Man dong oromo; wek dong obedi.” Onongo lamalaika pa Rwot tye inget laro moyo pa Arauna ma jo Jebuc. <verse eid="2SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Ka Daudi oneno kom lamalaika matye kaneko lwaki, ci owaco bot Rwot ni, “Nen, atyeko tiyo bal, atimo roc madit; ento lwak romi man gutimo kit roc ango? Alegi ni, wek cingi opot ikoma ki ikom jo me ot pa wora keken.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Ci Gad dok obino bot Daudi inino meno, ci owace ni, “Dong icit kacano keno tyer pi Rwot i laro moyo pa Arauna ma jo Jebuc.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Daudi ocito kunu kit ma Rwot ocike kwede pi lok pa Gad. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Ka Arauna obolo wange kaneno piny, ci oneno rwot ki lutice ka gibino gikemo en atir, ci ocito omiyo woro bot rwot kun oryebe piny inyime.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Ci Arauna openye ni, “Pingo ibino bota tin, ladita rwot?” Ci Daudi ogamo ni, “Abino kawilo laro moyoni wek acan iye keno tyer pi Rwot wek two gemo okee woko ki ikom lwak.” <verse eid="2SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Arauna owaco bot Daudi ni, “Ladita rwot in iter larona, ityer iye gin ma ineno ni ber. Twoni me gitum awanga bene ene, ki opam me dino bel ki rii ngut twoni gubed me yen. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Magi ducu an Arauna amiyo boti, rwot.” Arauna dok owaco bot rwot ni, “Rwot Lubangani aye ogam moti.” <verse eid="2SA 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Ento rwot ogamo dog Arauna ni, “Pe kumeno, abiwilogi ki boti awila, kun aculu pire ki lim; pien pe atwero tyero gitum awanga mo bot Rwot Lubangana ma pe awilo ki lima.” Kitmeno Daudi owilo laro moyo pa Arauna wa ki twonine bene, en oculu cekel me ryal pyere abic pirgi. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Ci Daudi ocano iye keno tyer pi Rwot, ka otyero gitum awanga kunu, ki gityer me berbedo. Pieno Rwot owinyo bakodoge pi lwak ki pi lobogi, ci two gemo okee woko ki i lobo Icrael.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>